L000021741024000019_a991-unileverplcannualre,rfs,1,flag,,,"In 2022, Unilever commenced a €3bn share buyback programme over two years"
L000021741024000019_a991-unileverplcannualre,term_years,3.0,years,,,"The Committee recommended to the Board that there is a reasonable expectation that the Group will be able to continue in operation and meet its liabilities as they fall due over the three-year period (consistent with the period of the strategic plan) of the assessment; and ■ consider whether the Unilever Annual Report and Accounts 2023 was fair, balanced, and understandable, and whether it provided the necessary information for shareholders to assess the Group’s year-end position and performance, business model and strategy"
