L000071894026000009_a2026-q2xmda,usd_other,234.0,$M,,,"The growth in BCE operating revenues was driven by an increase in Bell CTS of 0.4% in the quarter and 2.5% year to date, as a result of the contribution from our Bell CTS U.S. segment of $234 million and $468 million, respectively, due to the acquisition of Ziply Fiber on August 1, 2025, partly offset by a decline in our Bell CTS Canada segment of 4.0% and 2.0%, respectively, while revenues in our Bell Media segment grew by 8.9% in Q2 2026 and 4.8% year to date. . . . . . . . 14 BCE Inc. 2026 SECOND QUARTER SHAREHOLDER REPORT . . . . . . . . . . . . . 2.4 Operating costs"
