L000095010325012168_dp234624_ex9902,mw_gross,2400.0,MW,~,gross,Growth of AI/HPC Data Centers Grid Optimization Bitcoin Adoption Pipeline ~2.4 GW 5 Executing on Cipher’s AI / HPC Strategy via Notable Transaction ~2.4 GW Pipeline x We believe Cipher is well positioned to meet surging AI demand with 7 sites suitable for HPC workloads Dual Track Monetization x Poised to earn attractive Bitcoin mining returns with lowest - cost power while preserving efficient pivot to HPC Best - In - Class Team x Experienced team across data center construction and operations with deep expertise in building and operating Tier 3 data centers for hyperscalers
