L000095010325014194_dp236870_8k-financials,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,"(“Cipher” or the “Company”) on September 25, 2025, Cipher Barber Lake LLC, the Company’s wholly-owned indirect subsidiary, entered into a lease with Fluidstack USA II Inc"
L000095010325014194_dp236870_8k-financials,mw_unspecified,244.0,MW,,unspecified,"(“Fluidstack”) and other agreements relating to the development and lease of a 244 MW HPC data center facility near Colorado City, Texas (the “Barber Lake Facility”)"
