L000095014224002511_eh240539927_ex9901,mw_unspecified,2.0,MW,,unspecified,"TeraWulf recently completed a 2 MW AI/HPC proof-of-concept project, designed to support both current and next-generation GPU technology"
L000095014224002511_eh240539927_ex9901,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"Additionally, the Company is constructing a 20 MW colocation building, CB-1, at Lake Mariner, engineered to handle a critical IT load of 16 MW with advanced liquid cooling and Tier 3 redundancy features"
