L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,annual_revenue,1.5,$M,,,"With $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt annually on approximately $6 million per megawatt build cost at a 70% EBITDA margin, we estimate a 17% to 18% unlevered yield with an extremely well-capitalized, high-quality tenant"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,annual_revenue,6.0,$M,approximately,,"With $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt annually on approximately $6 million per megawatt build cost at a 70% EBITDA margin, we estimate a 17% to 18% unlevered yield with an extremely well-capitalized, high-quality tenant"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"Patrick, could you discuss the economics of the first 72.5 megawatts from the TeraWulf perspective?"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,financing_or_capex,5.0,$M,,,"And so, just to repeat, it's $5 million of CapEx per gross megawatt, excuse me, then adjusting for a 1.2 PUE drives CapEx of $6 million per megawatt of critical IT load. $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt at a 70% EBITDA margin is $1.05 million per megawatt of EBITDA"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,financing_or_capex,6.0,$M,,,"And so, just to repeat, it's $5 million of CapEx per gross megawatt, excuse me, then adjusting for a 1.2 PUE drives CapEx of $6 million per megawatt of critical IT load. $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt at a 70% EBITDA margin is $1.05 million per megawatt of EBITDA"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,financing_or_capex,1.5,$M,,,"And so, just to repeat, it's $5 million of CapEx per gross megawatt, excuse me, then adjusting for a 1.2 PUE drives CapEx of $6 million per megawatt of critical IT load. $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt at a 70% EBITDA margin is $1.05 million per megawatt of EBITDA"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,1.05,$M,,,"And so, just to repeat, it's $5 million of CapEx per gross megawatt, excuse me, then adjusting for a 1.2 PUE drives CapEx of $6 million per megawatt of critical IT load. $1.5 million of revenue per megawatt at a 70% EBITDA margin is $1.05 million per megawatt of EBITDA"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,financing_or_capex,1.05,$M,,,"So, when you think of those figures, it's $1.05 million of EBITDA per megawatt divided by $6 million of CapEx per megawatt of critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,financing_or_capex,6.0,$M,,,"So, when you think of those figures, it's $1.05 million of EBITDA per megawatt divided by $6 million of CapEx per megawatt of critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,term_years,20.0,years,,,"And so, it takes time to work through this agreement, and let's not forget this is a 10 to 20-year agreement"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"So, we did have other counterparties, who were very close to the finish line here on this initial 72.5 megawatts"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"And while we opted for one customer to take that full amount of 72.5 megawatts, we do remain in dialogue with the other parties"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_gross,135.0,MW,,gross,"The -- as was noted earlier, the agreement reflects an option for 135 megawatts of gross incremental capacity, 108 megawatts of net critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_it,108.0,MW,,it,"The -- as was noted earlier, the agreement reflects an option for 135 megawatts of gross incremental capacity, 108 megawatts of net critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,500.0,MW,,unspecified,"And I think of the deployment of the 500 megawatts that we've currently circled for AI compute, and that is not all of our development pipeline"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Terawulf Inc (WULF US Equity) . . . takes 3 to 3.5 years, so, I think it's safe to assume 100 megawatts to 150 megawatts a year"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,150.0,MW,,unspecified,"Terawulf Inc (WULF US Equity) . . . takes 3 to 3.5 years, so, I think it's safe to assume 100 megawatts to 150 megawatts a year"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,250.0,MW,,unspecified,"Regarding the megawatts that we currently use for Bitcoin mining, or the 250 megawatts that we've told the world that we've allocated to it"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,250.0,MW,,unspecified,"But in the meantime, the 250 megawatts will generate a ton of free cash flow for us"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,1.5,$M,,,How sustainable do you think the $1.5 million per megawatt revenue number is going forward?
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,power_cost,1,flag,,,And our power costs are typically below market averages of about $0.045
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,6.0,$M,,,"So, can you just talk about how confident do you feel about the $6 million to $8 million per megawatt estimated build costs going forward?"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,8.0,$M,,,"So, can you just talk about how confident do you feel about the $6 million to $8 million per megawatt estimated build costs going forward?"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,6.0,$M,,,"But generally, we're pretty confident that being able to deliver on that $6 million to $8 million per megawatt for buildings beyond CB2 is possible, again, if we're kind of back in the market here within the next three, four months or so"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,8.0,$M,,,"But generally, we're pretty confident that being able to deliver on that $6 million to $8 million per megawatt for buildings beyond CB2 is possible, again, if we're kind of back in the market here within the next three, four months or so"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,We're going from Hopper to Blackwell to Rubin on the NVIDIA roadmap
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"And NVIDIA as you know kind of out there saying that, every six to eight months they're going to come out with a new design"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"And as Paul mentioned, many people thought the Core Sci, CoreWeave deal from an economic perspective was a one-off, your thoughts on how the deals compare?"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,380.0,$M,over,,"And I think, if folks remember, on Page 13 of our last quarter investor deck, we showed, if we accomplish that, we have over $380 million of unallocated cash available next year to fund returns to shareholders"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,credit_support,1,flag,,,"We have a corporate guarantee from G42, which is backed by a sovereign government with a credit rating and CDS that trades virtually on top of the U.S. government CDS"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,Microsoft,,,,"Moreover, G42 is a beneficiary of a very large investment from Microsoft, alongside some of the most successful and largest fund managers in the world"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"But we, and then to be even more clear, we do not need any additional financing for this first 72.5 megawatts, again that was equity funded"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,term_years,5.0,years,,,"But remember, we do have two five-year extensions beyond the initial 10-year term"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,term_years,10.0,years,,,"But remember, we do have two five-year extensions beyond the initial 10-year term"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,108.0,MW,,unspecified,"With Core42, we have an option embedded within the lease agreements, the 108 megawatts that we've talked about"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"Core42 is backed by G42, both top-tier customers of NVIDIA, both partners with Dell, G42 backed by, a sovereign wealth fund, a tremendous reputation"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_it,60.0,MW,,it,"And then over the course of the first two quarters of next year, there's going to be over $2 billion of hardware that's going to show up at our site that's going to populate the 60 megawatts of critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,2000.0,$M,over,,"And then over the course of the first two quarters of next year, there's going to be over $2 billion of hardware that's going to show up at our site that's going to populate the 60 megawatts of critical IT load"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_unspecified,700.0,MW,,unspecified,"I think, importantly, and we've talked about this before, the people who operate the Lake Mariner data center facilities are many of the same individuals who worked at the site when it was a 700 megawatt coal plant"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,Members of the NVIDIA team have been on our site multiple times
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,usd_other,2000.0,$M,over,,"And as mentioned earlier, over $2 billion of hardware will be at our site"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,mw_it,16.0,MW,,it,"Again, CB-1 we've outlined, 16 megawatt critical IT load facility"
L000095014224002999_eh240572111_ex9901,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"Core42 really dug into design, brought Dell and NVIDIA into the picture early on to work on diligencing the site, what we were capable of there"
