L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,financing_or_capex,100.0,$M,,,"On January 25, 2024, the Company announced it extended its $100.0 million unsecured term loan executed in 2016 (the “2016 Term Loan”) for the facility and extended the weighted average life of maturities at attractive spreads, underscoring the Company’s fortified balance sheet and strong capital partner relationships"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,financing_or_capex,400.0,$M,,,"On June 4, 2024, the Company announced it has executed a new $400.0 million revolving credit facility"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,contract_value,300.0,$M,up to,,"The Revolver includes an accordion feature that allows the Company to request additional lender commitments of . 2 . . . . . . up to $300.0 million, for a total Revolver capacity of up to $700.0 million"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,contract_value,700.0,$M,up to,,"The Revolver includes an accordion feature that allows the Company to request additional lender commitments of . 2 . . . . . . up to $300.0 million, for a total Revolver capacity of up to $700.0 million"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,usd_other,71.1,$M,approximately,,"In the year ended December 31, 2024, the Company issued an aggregate of 5,491,217 shares of the Company's common stock in settlement of forward sales transactions through the 2019 ATM Program at a weighted average price per share of $12.95, raising net proceeds to the Company of approximately $71.1 million"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,20.0,years,,,"On March 4, 2024, the Company announced it has been awarded a 20-year non-cancelable lease for a 50,777 rentable square foot Federal courthouse in Flagstaff, Arizona"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,20.0,years,,,"Once the development is complete, a brand-new 20-year firm term lease will commence with the GSA for the benefit of the United States Judiciary"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,rfs,1,flag,,,"Once the development is complete, a brand-new 20-year firm term lease will commence with the GSA for the benefit of the United States Judiciary"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,15.0,years,,,"On May 7, 2024, the Company acquired a 27,840 square foot facility 100% leased to Homeland Security Investigations (HSI), the principal investigation arm within the Department of Homeland Security (DHS), with a 15-year lease that does not expire until March 2036, and located in Orlando, Florida (“HSI - Orlando”)"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,20.0,years,,,The Orlando-based property features a 20-year lease that does not expire until August 2040
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,financing_or_capex,52.1,$M,up to,,"On August 6, 2024, the Company entered into a construction loan agreement to lend up to $52.1 million to a developer (the “Borrower”) in connection with the re-development of an approximately 68,669 square foot Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA) facility located in Bedford, Massachusetts (“DEA - Bedford”)"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,20.0,years,,,VA - Jacksonville is the final property to be acquired in the previously announced portfolio of 10 properties 100% leased to the VA under predominately 20-year firm term leases
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,annual_revenue,2500.0,$M,,,"The property is located immediately west of Buckley SFB, which contributes an estimated $2.5 billion annually to the local economy and provides strategic and theater missile warning to the United States and its International Partners"
L000095017025026058_dea-ex99_1,term_years,5.0,years,,,IRS - Ogden is used as the IRS’s internal mail processing center and features a lease that expires in January 2029 and contains two five-year options that extend the lease through January 2039
