L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,credit_support,1,flag,,,"The Company’s management team has limited or no experience in the HPC/AI industry and is expanding its team to include additional professionals, including external consultants, with such experience, but there is no guarantee that such efforts will be successful"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"It decided to allocate to this new class an aggregate supply of 300 megawatts of electricity, with the requirement to curtail electricity use during peak hours at Hydro-Québec’s request (up to a maximum of 300 hours a year)"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,Cryptocurrency Mining projects would be required to submit tenders to consume electricity from the 300 megawatt block based exclusively on economic development and environmental criteria
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,term_years,3.0,years,,,"In considering the financial consequences of this conclusion, the Régie requested that Hydro-Québec implement the non-firm service for existing clients during a three-year period through progressive implementation"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"On November 17, 2021, in Step 3 of the Régie’s regulatory proceedings, the Régie ratified the process for allocating the balance of the 300 MW block reserved for crypto miners that was not already allocated pursuant to the call for tenders approved in Step 2"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"The allocation process of the balance of the 300 MW block would be based on a “first come, first serve” process, without any reference to economic development condition and environmental criteria"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"On May 30, 2022, the Company filed with the Régie an administrative complaint against Hydro-Québec requesting information regarding the process for the allocation of the balance of the 300 MW block"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"On June 30, 2022, Hydro-Québec responded to the Company’s administrative complaint confirming that the allocation process of the 300 MW block would be opened in September 2022"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"On November 1, 2022, Hydro-Québec submitted to the Régie its Supply Plan for the period 2023 to 2032 and requested the Régie authorize the suspension of the allocation process for the granting of the balance of the 300 MW reserved block and to reassess the amount of MWs to be allocated to crypto miners for future operations"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"The Company has actively participated in the regulatory process on the approval, by the Régie, of the Supply Plan and has challenged Hydro-Québec’s request to suspend the allocation of the 300 MW block"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"On January 10, 2023, the Régie rendered its decision on Hydro-Québec’s request to suspend the allocation process for the granting of the 300 MW reserved block"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,270.0,MW,approximately,unspecified,"On September 9, 2023, the Régie approved the reduction to zero MW for the remaining quantity of the reserved block, which totaled approximately 270MW at the time"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,32.6,MW,,unspecified,"In addition, the Régie decided to maintain the 32.6 MW of the reserved block that had already been allocated to CB tariff clients"
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,32.6,MW,,unspecified,The Régie requested Hydro-Québec to amend the Conditions of Service for Cryptographic Use Applied to Blockchains and propose a new process for the eventual reallocation of the MW that could become available from the 32.6 MW reserved block already allocated
L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_unspecified,5.0,MW,,unspecified,"Currently, the Cowansville Data Center is subject to a preferential rate of 5% on its first 5 MW of power; and the Farnham Facility is subject to a preferential rate of 20% on its first 10 MW of power"
