L000101376225002979_ea023573301ex99-2_bitfarms,mw_gross,2000.0,MW,more than,gross,"Grant PUD was established in 1938 and is a public utility district that owns and operates hydro-electric plants capable of generating more than 2,000 MW of electricity"
