L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,5000.0,$M,,,"• Revenue of $5.0 billion, increased 3.0% year-over-year or 2.7% in constant currency 1 , the high end of our guidance ranges"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,26200.0,$M,,,• Trailing 12-month bookings of $26.2 billion; book-to-bill of 1.3x
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,contract_value,100.0,$M,more than,,"In the third quarter, we signed six deals with total contract value of more than $100 million each, bringing our year-to-date count to nineteen, which is more than we signed in the full-year 2023"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,rfs,1,flag,,,"See “About Non-GAAP Financial Measures and Performance Metrics” for more information and, as applicable, reconciliations to the most directly comparable GAAP financial measures. . . . . . . . . . . ""In the third quarter, we delivered organic revenue growth both sequentially and year-over-year while also achieving sequential gross margin expansion, driven by better utilization and AI-led productivity, and Adjusted EPS growth of more than 7% year-over-year,"" said Jatin Dalal, Chief Financial Officer. ""Our focus on operating cost discipline and savings generated through our strong execution under the NextGen program have allowed us to expand year-to-date Adjusted Operating Margin by approximately 40 basis points"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,26200.0,$M,,,"On a trailing-twelve-month basis, bookings declined 2% year-over-year to $26.2 billion, which represented a book-to-bill of approximately 1.3x"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,contract_value,100.0,$M,,,"During the quarter, we signed six deals each with total contract value of $100 million or greater"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,228.0,$M,,,The Company repurchased 3.1 million shares for $228 million during the third quarter under its share repurchase program
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,1400.0,$M,,,"As of September 30, 2024, there was $1.4 billion remaining under the share repurchase authorization"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,5100.0,$M,,,"• Fourth quarter revenue is expected to be $5.0 - $5.1 billion, growth of 5.1% to 7.1%, or an increase of 4.8% to 6.8% in constant currency"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,19800.0,$M,,,"• Full-year 2024 revenue is expected to be $19.7 - $19.8 billion, growth of 1.6% to 2.1% or an increase of 1.4% to 1.9% in constant currency basis"
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,usd_other,1300.0,$M,approximately,,• The Company completed the acquisition of Belcan for approximately $1.3 billion in cash and stock during the third quarter
L000105829024000325_exhibit9919302024,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,• Announced new collaboration with NVIDIA to bring enhanced capabilities to our data modernization offering
