L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"The Company is undertaking a 300 MW expansion of its hashrate services infrastructure in calendar 2025, across its Yguazú and Valenzuela sites"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"As of the date of this report, Phase 1 at Yguazú is complete, with 100% of the initial 100 MW capacity energized"
