L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Phase 2 scaled throughout summer 2025, adding another 100 MW and approximately 6.5 EH/s of hashrate and was completed early September 2025"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Phase 3 contributes an additional 100 MW and 6.5 EH/s, bringing the Company’s total installed capacity to approximately 25 EH/s"
