L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,usd_other,500.0,$M,,,"In the Company’s Amended and Restated Short Form Base Shelf Prospectus dated January 4, 2022, the Company disclosed that it was targeting a hashrate capacity of 10.0 EH/s by the end of the calendar 2022 year at an aggregate cost of $500 million"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,usd_other,107.0,$M,,,"The Company achieved hashrate capacity of 5.0 EH/s in April 2024 at an aggregate cost of $107 million, and the Company’s hashrate capacity as of June 30, 2025 was 11.3 EH/s, as a result of the delivery and installation of the AISC machines from orders placed in June 2024 and November 2024"
