L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"The Company notes that it had successfully installed 4,800 Nvidia A-series GPUs in Tier-III data centers (comprised of A40, A6000, A5000 and A4000 cards) operating in Supermicro servers, additionally the Company purchased 96 Nvidia H100 GPUs installed in Dell servers in December 2023"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"In calendar Q4 2024, the Company purchased an additional 248 Nvidia H100 GPUs installed in Supermicro servers with InfiniBand, and in calendar Q1 2025 purchased and installed 504 Nvidia H200 GPUs in Super Micro servers with InfiniBand"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"The Company currently operates approximately 4,300 Nvidia A-series GPUs (previously 4,650) since the Company found optimal configuration for certain AI application to have 8 GPUs per server for the Nvidia A40, instead of 10 GPUs per server for the A5000 and A4000"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"The Company has found growing demand for the A40 GPU, and thus the majority of the 480 Supermicro servers now run 8 Nvidia A40 GPUs"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"In total the Company is operating approximately 5,150 Nvidia GPUs as of this report date, primarily comprised of the 344 Nvidia H100 GPU, 504 Nvidia H200 GPUs and approximately 4,300 Nvidia A-series GPUs (A40s, A6000 and A5000)"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,usd_other,20.0,$M,,,"On May 27, 2025, the Company announced it had reached $20M ARR 3 target for the HPC business"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,usd_other,23.0,$M,approximately,,"The Company has realized peak daily revenue of $63,000 from the HPC business, which is approximately $23M ARR"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,annual_revenue,15.2,$M,,,"The Company for the nine month period ended December 31, 2025 realized $15.2 million of revenue from the HPC business.. 3 The Company calculates run rate revenue on an annual basis by multiplying the revenue realized per week times 52 weeks per year"
L000106299326000943_exhibit99-2,contract_value,493.0,$M,approximately,,"Over the next 36 months, the Company anticipates significant capital expenditures associated with expansion of its HPC business operations, totaling up to approximately $493 million"
