L000106299326001492_exhibit99-1,mw_unspecified,3.0,MW,,unspecified,"BUZZ has deployed 504 next-generation AI-optimized GPUs consuming approximately 1 MW, with 3 MW of remaining capacity to support approximately 1,500 additional GPUs"
