L000106299326001492_exhibit99-1,annual_revenue,200.0,$M,,,"The Company expects further expand another 2000 high-power density GPUs through additional partner data centers or its own data centers, reaching 6000 GPUs in Canada, with a target of $200 million in contracted annualized run-rate revenue (""HPC ARR"") by the end of this fiscal year (period end March 31, 2027)"
L000106299326001492_exhibit99-1,mw_unspecified,70.0,MW,,unspecified,"Notably, indications to management are that our 70 MW site in New Brunswick offers the scale of powered land for hyperscaler needs, and we believe the location of our 7.6 MW Toronto Airport site is very attractive to government or military applications."""
