L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,25.0,MW,,unspecified,"With 25 megawatts of contracted capacity planned for deployment in 2026 and now more than 75 megawatts under contract following the Axe Compute expansion, a growing backlog, and increasing demand for AI infrastructure, we remain focused on execution and on converting the opportunities in front of us into long-term recurring revenue and shareholder value"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,75.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"With 25 megawatts of contracted capacity planned for deployment in 2026 and now more than 75 megawatts under contract following the Axe Compute expansion, a growing backlog, and increasing demand for AI infrastructure, we remain focused on execution and on converting the opportunities in front of us into long-term recurring revenue and shareholder value"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_it,55.0,MW,,it,Was that 55 megawatts IT load or gross?
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_gross,55.0,MW,,gross,"Yes, that's gross -- the 55 megawatt is gross"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"So, the 10 meg that's being deployed in Georgia, then you have another 50 megawatts plus contracted recently, actually this week"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,40.0,$M,,,"So, without that clean room, there's -- people aren't putting $40 million worth of GPU or $100 million worth of GPU in a cluster that's in a modular environment"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,100.0,$M,,,"So, without that clean room, there's -- people aren't putting $40 million worth of GPU or $100 million worth of GPU in a cluster that's in a modular environment"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,And those are in the range of 5 to 20 megawatts
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,25.0,MW,,unspecified,"Doug, I'm curious, could you go in a little deeper on the pipeline in the Tier 3, Tier 4 markets beyond the 25 megawatts and the 55 for Axe?"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,over,unspecified,"So, we're well over 100 megawatts in 5 to 10 meg tranches in our funnel just for this year"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,7.0,MW,over,unspecified,We've actually installed over 7 megawatts of new infrastructure
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,fitout,1,flag,,,"You bypass everything that's in the building except for the fiber build-out, and we brought everything in brand new, everything from generators to cooling plant all the way to PUs to cabinets to everything, lighting, raised floor"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,140.0,$M,,,"Maybe on the Axe deal, anything you can talk about sort of, I assume, who the end customer is just in terms of -- and I know you said they're going to deposit $140 million, so I assume it's a decent to your credit customer if they're putting in the cash"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,term_years,5.0,years,,,That's a five-year term
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,term_years,5.0,years,,,Because the payback period seems pretty attractive so far at least on the five-year deals you've signed here
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"But just maybe talk about going forward and funding how you think of, I guess, to sign the additional 100 megawatts you talked about in the pipeline just how you think about financing going forward?"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,140.0,$M,,,"So, I have this basically infrastructure, that's $140 million that I can borrow against, number one"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,4.4,$M,,,"So, that $4.4 million will start here very soon, and then that will give us more credibility, more money on our balance sheet and --"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,1.0,$M,,,"Like you say our model, you say this is our model, and that's how I take it is we were doing this for $1 million a unit"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,usd_other,30.0,$M,,,"Suddenly, we needed $30 million for a unit"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,10.0,MW,,unspecified,"But yeah -- so, when we go into a market and say I deploy 10 megawatt, say that customer goes away in three years, right?"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"Right now, if I had 20 megawatt -- right now, if I had 10 megawatt -- if I had 4 megawatt right now available today, I have probably 16 customers lined up to take it"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,10.0,MW,,unspecified,"Right now, if I had 20 megawatt -- right now, if I had 10 megawatt -- if I had 4 megawatt right now available today, I have probably 16 customers lined up to take it"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,4.0,MW,,unspecified,"Right now, if I had 20 megawatt -- right now, if I had 10 megawatt -- if I had 4 megawatt right now available today, I have probably 16 customers lined up to take it"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,10.0,MW,,unspecified,We could just get the 10 megawatts ready for them there
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,term_years,5.0,years,,,And that's the five-year 111?
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,mw_unspecified,10.0,MW,,unspecified,"What's the rationale behind 10 megawatts going for 176 for three years, and then 10 going for 111 for five years?"
L000107997326001150_ex99x2,credit_support,1,flag,,,"We caution you that these statements are not guarantees of future performance or events and are subject to a number of uncertainties, risks, and other influences, many of which are beyond our control, which may influence the accuracy of the statements and the projections upon which the statements are based and could cause Duos Technologies Group Inc.'s actual results to differ materially from those anticipated by the forward-looking statements"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,usd_other,49.0,$M,,,"EX-99.1 2 exhibit991-earningsrelea.htm EX-99.1 exhibit991-earningsrelea TeraWulf Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2023 Results Annual Revenue Grows 360% Year-Over-Year; Annual BTC Self-Mined Increases 550% to 3,407 Reports Realized Cost of Power of 3.2 Cents Per Kilowatt Hour in 2023, Outperforming Company Guidance of 3.5 Cents Per Kilowatt Hour by 9% Self-Mining Operating Capacity Reaches 8 EH/s, More Than Quadrupling Capacity Since Beginning of 2023 Reports Current Cash and Bitcoin Holdings of $49 million as of February 29, 2024 EASTON, Md., March 19, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TeraWulf Inc"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"Our strategic plan entails reaching operational capacity of 300 MW by the close of 2024 and scaling up to 550 MW by the conclusion of 2025.” Patrick Fleury, TeraWulf’s Chief Financial Officer added, “In 2023, TeraWulf demonstrated exceptional operational performance and expansive growth, resulting in record levels of revenue and profitability, as demonstrated by both GAAP and non-GAAP metrics"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,mw_unspecified,550.0,MW,up to,unspecified,"Our strategic plan entails reaching operational capacity of 300 MW by the close of 2024 and scaling up to 550 MW by the conclusion of 2025.” Patrick Fleury, TeraWulf’s Chief Financial Officer added, “In 2023, TeraWulf demonstrated exceptional operational performance and expansive growth, resulting in record levels of revenue and profitability, as demonstrated by both GAAP and non-GAAP metrics"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,usd_other,40.0,$M,,,"With an industry-leading 3.2 cents per kilowatt hour cost of power, we also achieved a substantial reduction in our debt of $40 million in the aggregate as of February 29, 2024, significantly bolstering our financial standing"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,usd_other,49.0,$M,,,"As of the end of February, our balance sheet reflects a fortified financial foundation, with $49 million in cash and cash equivalents and bitcoin"
L000108330124000066_exhibit991-earningsrelea,usd_other,69.2,$M,,,"This substantial reduction in debt and enhanced liquidity position underscores TeraWulf's resolute commitment to prudent financial management, positioning us even more securely to capitalize on future opportunities with confidence.” “As we look ahead, we're excited to leverage our highly efficient and cost-effective infrastructure to significantly expand hash rate at our top tier sites,” added Nazar Khan, Chief Operating Officer of TeraWulf. “Additionally, we're actively pursuing opportunities to optimize the utilization of our proprietary infrastructure and unlock additional value, including the assessment of advanced AI and HPC applications.” Full Year 2023 Operational and Financial Highlights Key financial and operational highlights for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023 include: Š Revenue increased 360% to $69.2 million in 2023, as compared to $15.0 million in fiscal 2022 driven by increased bitcoin production and higher average realized bitcoin prices during the period. Š Gross profit increased 960% to $41.9 million in 2023, as compared to $4.0 million in fiscal 2022. Š Non-GAAP adjusted EBITDA increased by $64.9 million to $30.7 million in 2023, as compared to $(34.2) million in fiscal 2022. Š Reported cash and cash equivalents of $54.4 million as of December 31, 2023, as compared to $1.3 million at fiscal year-end 2022. Š Net debt¹ at fiscal year-end 2023 declined 41% to $84.9 million, as compared to $144.7 million at fiscal year-end 2022"
