L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,contract_value,92.0,$M,approximately,,"Recent Strategic Development On October 3, 2024, TeraWulf announced the closing of the sale of its 25% equity interest in the Nautilus facility for total consideration of approximately $92 million"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"The Company plans to reinvest this capital into the construction of the 20 MW CB-1 facility at Lake Mariner, as detailed further below"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,2.0,MW,,unspecified,"This strategic reinvestment strengthens our ongoing initiatives, including the successful completion of our 2 MW 'WULF Den' proof- of-concept for WULF Compute, designed for high-density GPU workloads"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"Construction of CB-1, our 20 MW HPC/AI facility at Lake Mariner, is on track, with completion expected in Q1 2025"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"We’ve also secured long-lead items for CB-2, a 50 MW AI/HPC facility, to ensure timely completion in early Q2 2025."" Production and Operations Update As of September 30, 2024, TeraWulf's operational bitcoin mining capacity included 195 MW at the Lake Mariner facility and 50 MW at the Nautilus facility"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,195.0,MW,,unspecified,"We’ve also secured long-lead items for CB-2, a 50 MW AI/HPC facility, to ensure timely completion in early Q2 2025."" Production and Operations Update As of September 30, 2024, TeraWulf's operational bitcoin mining capacity included 195 MW at the Lake Mariner facility and 50 MW at the Nautilus facility"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"We’ve also secured long-lead items for CB-2, a 50 MW AI/HPC facility, to ensure timely completion in early Q2 2025."" Production and Operations Update As of September 30, 2024, TeraWulf's operational bitcoin mining capacity included 195 MW at the Lake Mariner facility and 50 MW at the Nautilus facility"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_gross,2.5,MW,,gross,"This includes the recent completion of a 2.5 MW (gross) HPC/AI digital infrastructure proof-of-concept project, designed to support both current and next-generation GPU technology"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"Furthermore, TeraWulf is constructing CB-1, a 20 MW colocation building engineered to support 16 MW of critical IT load with liquid cooling and redundancy features typical of a Tier 3 data center (e.g., N+1 redundant cooling systems, variable speed fans, chilled water systems, dual power supply and redundant fiber network paths)"
L000108330124000132_wulfopsreportsep2410-03x,mw_it,16.0,MW,,it,"Furthermore, TeraWulf is constructing CB-1, a 20 MW colocation building engineered to support 16 MW of critical IT load with liquid cooling and redundancy features typical of a Tier 3 data center (e.g., N+1 redundant cooling systems, variable speed fans, chilled water systems, dual power supply and redundant fiber network paths)"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,27.1,$M,,,EX-99.1 2 aex991xearningsreleasexq.htm EX-99.1 aex991xearningsreleasexq Exhibit 99.1 TeraWulf Reports Third Quarter 2024 Financial Results Q3 2024 Revenue of $27.1 million and Non-GAAP Adjusted EBITDA of $6.0 million
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,6.0,$M,,,EX-99.1 2 aex991xearningsreleasexq.htm EX-99.1 aex991xearningsreleasexq Exhibit 99.1 TeraWulf Reports Third Quarter 2024 Financial Results Q3 2024 Revenue of $27.1 million and Non-GAAP Adjusted EBITDA of $6.0 million
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,27.1,$M,,,• Revenue increased to $27.1 million in Q3 2024 compared to $19.0 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,19.0,$M,,,• Revenue increased to $27.1 million in Q3 2024 compared to $19.0 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,14.7,$M,,,• Cost of revenue (exclusive of depreciation) increased to $14.7 million in Q3 2024 compared to $8.3 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,8.3,$M,,,• Cost of revenue (exclusive of depreciation) increased to $14.7 million in Q3 2024 compared to $8.3 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,contract_value,33.9,$M,,,• Total value of bitcoin self-mined1 of $33.9 million in Q3 2024 compared to $27.6 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,contract_value,27.6,$M,,,• Total value of bitcoin self-mined1 of $33.9 million in Q3 2024 compared to $27.6 million in Q3 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,6.0,$M,,,"• Adjusted EBITDA of $6.0 million in Q3 2024, an decrease of 33.6% from $9.0 million in Q3 2023. 1 Excludes BTC earned from profit sharing associated with a hosting agreement that expired in February 2024 at the Lake Mariner Facility and includes TeraWulf's net share of BTC produced at the Nautilus Cryptomine Facility"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,9.0,$M,,,"• Adjusted EBITDA of $6.0 million in Q3 2024, an decrease of 33.6% from $9.0 million in Q3 2023. 1 Excludes BTC earned from profit sharing associated with a hosting agreement that expired in February 2024 at the Lake Mariner Facility and includes TeraWulf's net share of BTC produced at the Nautilus Cryptomine Facility"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,2.5,MW,,unspecified,• Completed construction of 2.5 MW HPC hosting proof-of-concept project at Lake Mariner
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,200.0,$M,,,• Announced board of director approval for $200.0 million inaugural share repurchase program
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,financing_or_capex,500.0,$M,,,"• Completed $500.0 million convertible notes offering and simultaneous repurchase of $115.0 million worth of TeraWulf shares. 2 The Company’s share of the earnings or losses of operating results at the Nautilus Cryptomine Facility is reflected within “Equity in net income (loss) of investee, net of tax” in the condensed consolidated statements of operations"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,financing_or_capex,115.0,$M,,,"• Completed $500.0 million convertible notes offering and simultaneous repurchase of $115.0 million worth of TeraWulf shares. 2 The Company’s share of the earnings or losses of operating results at the Nautilus Cryptomine Facility is reflected within “Equity in net income (loss) of investee, net of tax” in the condensed consolidated statements of operations"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,rfs,1,flag,,,"Management Commentary “The third quarter and the beginning of the fourth quarter marked a pivotal turning point for TeraWulf, as we delivered strong results across our strategic, financial, and operational objectives,” said Paul Prager, Chairman and CEO of TeraWulf. “The sale of our interest in the Nautilus joint venture not only generated a substantial return but also sharpened our focus on scaling high-performance computing at Lake Mariner"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,750.0,MW,,unspecified,Securing an expanded ground lease with exclusive rights to 750 MW of infrastructure capacity is a significant milestone in our growth strategy
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,500.0,$M,,,"Combined with the success of our $500.0 million capital raise, we are exceptionally well-positioned to seize new opportunities in both Bitcoin mining and HPC hosting as we enter 2025.” Prager continued, “We are excited about the surging demand for high-performance computing and the unique opportunity it presents for TeraWulf"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,financing_or_capex,500.0,$M,,,"In October, we secured $500.0 million in convertible notes financing, using $60 million for a capped call to neutralize dilution up to a share price of $12.80"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,financing_or_capex,60.0,$M,,,"In October, we secured $500.0 million in convertible notes financing, using $60 million for a capped call to neutralize dilution up to a share price of $12.80"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,115.0,$M,,,"Simultaneously, we repurchased $115.0 million in common stock, resulting in no effective dilution until the stock exceeds $18.00 per share"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,195.0,MW,approximately,unspecified,"This strategic move reinforces our commitment to shareholder value and positions us for strong growth ahead."" Operations Update TeraWulf's current operational Bitcoin mining capacity includes approximately 195 MW at the Lake Mariner Facility"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,2.5,MW,,unspecified,"Notable milestones include the successful completion of a 2.5 MW HPC proof-of-concept project, specifically designed to support both current and next-generation GPU technologies"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"The construction of CB-1, a 20 MW Tier 3-grade HPC hosting facility, is progressing on schedule and is expected to be completed by Q1 2025"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"Preparations for CB-2, a 50 MW HPC hosting facility, are also well advanced, with key components already secured, positioning the Company for a timely launch by the end of Q2 2025"
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,27.1,$M,,,Third Quarter 2024 GAAP Financial Results Revenue in the third quarter of 2024 increased 42.8% to $27.1 million as compared to $19.0 million in the third quarter of 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,19.0,$M,,,Third Quarter 2024 GAAP Financial Results Revenue in the third quarter of 2024 increased 42.8% to $27.1 million as compared to $19.0 million in the third quarter of 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,14.7,$M,,,Cost of revenue (exclusive of depreciation) in the third quarter of 2024 increased 77.3% to $14.7 million compared to $8.3 million in the third quarter of 2023
L000108330124000145_aex991xearningsreleasexq,usd_other,8.3,$M,,,Cost of revenue (exclusive of depreciation) in the third quarter of 2024 increased 77.3% to $14.7 million compared to $8.3 million in the third quarter of 2023
