L000108330125000004_wulfopsreport-202412dec2,mw_unspecified,70.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"EX-99.1 2 wulfopsreport-202412dec2.htm EX-99.1 wulfopsreport-202412dec2 TeraWulf Announces December 2024 Production and Operations Update Secured high-performance computing (HPC) data center leases with Core42 for more than 70 MW of digital infrastructure, representing total revenue of more than $1 billion over initial 10-year term Earned 158 self-mined bitcoin in December for a total of 2,728 bitcoin year-to-date and 423 in Q4 2024 Achieved 9.7 EH/s of installed self-mining capacity, a 94% year-over-year increase EASTON, Md. – January 3, 2025 – TeraWulf Inc"
L000108330125000004_wulfopsreport-202412dec2,contract_value,1000.0,$M,more than,,"EX-99.1 2 wulfopsreport-202412dec2.htm EX-99.1 wulfopsreport-202412dec2 TeraWulf Announces December 2024 Production and Operations Update Secured high-performance computing (HPC) data center leases with Core42 for more than 70 MW of digital infrastructure, representing total revenue of more than $1 billion over initial 10-year term Earned 158 self-mined bitcoin in December for a total of 2,728 bitcoin year-to-date and 423 in Q4 2024 Achieved 9.7 EH/s of installed self-mining capacity, a 94% year-over-year increase EASTON, Md. – January 3, 2025 – TeraWulf Inc"
