L000108330125000013_a_wulfformearningsrelease2,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"A pivotal milestone in this expansion was achieved on December 23, 2024, when TeraWulf signed long-term data center lease agreements with Core42, securing 72.5 MW of hosting capacity at Lake Mariner for GPU cloud compute workloads"
