L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,500.0,MW,,unspecified,Reaffirms growth strategy targeting 250–500 MW of new contracted capacity annually
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,rfs,1,flag,,,"TeraWulf delivered a transformational third quarter, executing major commercial, operational, and financial milestones that position the Company as a leader in sustainable high-performance computing (HPC) infrastructure"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,contract_value,17000.0,$M,more than,,"In the third quarter and into the fourth quarter, the Company commenced recurring HPC lease revenue, signed more than $17 billion in long-term, credit-enhanced customer contracts, and completed over $5 billion in long-term financings to support its rapidly expanding platform"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,financing_or_capex,5000.0,$M,over,,"In the third quarter and into the fourth quarter, the Company commenced recurring HPC lease revenue, signed more than $17 billion in long-term, credit-enhanced customer contracts, and completed over $5 billion in long-term financings to support its rapidly expanding platform"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,rfs,1,flag,,,"In the third quarter and into the fourth quarter, the Company commenced recurring HPC lease revenue, signed more than $17 billion in long-term, credit-enhanced customer contracts, and completed over $5 billion in long-term financings to support its rapidly expanding platform"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,245.0,MW,,unspecified,"As of September 30, 2025, the site has energized 245 MW of Bitcoin-mining capacity and 22.5 MW of HPC capacity"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,22.5,MW,,unspecified,"As of September 30, 2025, the site has energized 245 MW of Bitcoin-mining capacity and 22.5 MW of HPC capacity"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,rfs,1,flag,,,"As of September 30, 2025, the site has energized 245 MW of Bitcoin-mining capacity and 22.5 MW of HPC capacity"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,520.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"Through subsidiaries La Lupa Data LLC and Akela Data LLC, the Company executed more than 520 MW of long-term HPC leases across multiple enterprise and hyperscale customers"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,72.5,MW,,unspecified,"Under the Core42 leases, La Lupa will deliver 72.5 MW of GPU-optimized capacity with approximately $1.1 billion in contracted revenue over ten years"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,contract_value,1100.0,$M,approximately,,"Under the Core42 leases, La Lupa will deliver 72.5 MW of GPU-optimized capacity with approximately $1.1 billion in contracted revenue over ten years"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,mw_unspecified,450.0,MW,,unspecified,"In August, Akela executed three ten-year Fluidstack leases, backed by Google, providing 450 MW of capacity and approximately $6.7 billion in contracted revenue"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,contract_value,6700.0,$M,approximately,,"In August, Akela executed three ten-year Fluidstack leases, backed by Google, providing 450 MW of capacity and approximately $6.7 billion in contracted revenue"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,term_years,10.0,years,,,"In August, Akela executed three ten-year Fluidstack leases, backed by Google, providing 450 MW of capacity and approximately $6.7 billion in contracted revenue"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,"In August, Akela executed three ten-year Fluidstack leases, backed by Google, providing 450 MW of capacity and approximately $6.7 billion in contracted revenue"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,tenant,Google,,,,"In August, Akela executed three ten-year Fluidstack leases, backed by Google, providing 450 MW of capacity and approximately $6.7 billion in contracted revenue"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,tenant,Google,,,,"These leases, scheduled to be delivered in phases through 2026, are financed and benefit from Google credit enhancement, creating durable, infrastructure-style cash flows"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,rfs,1,flag,,,"These leases, scheduled to be delivered in phases through 2026, are financed and benefit from Google credit enhancement, creating durable, infrastructure-style cash flows"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,"TeraWulf expanded its national footprint with the formation of the Abernathy Joint Venture in Texas, through its subsidiary Big Country Wulf LLC, partnering again with Fluidstack and Google"
L000108330125000096_a_wulfformearningsreleaseq,tenant,Google,,,,"TeraWulf expanded its national footprint with the formation of the Abernathy Joint Venture in Texas, through its subsidiary Big Country Wulf LLC, partnering again with Fluidstack and Google"
