L000108330126000026_a_wulfearningsrelease2026-,contract_value,12800.0,$M,more than,,"During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company commenced recurring HPC lease revenue, signed more than $12.8 billion 1 in long-term, credit-enhanced customer contracts, and completed $6.5 billion 2 in long-term financings to support its rapidly expanding platform"
