L000108330126000026_a_wulfearningsrelease2026-,mw_it,500.0,MW,more than,it,"Lake Mariner has advanced phased expansion to support hyperscale-class HPC deployments, with 39 critical IT MW HPC capacity online, more than 500 MW of near-term contracted campus capacity, and approximately 250 MW of incremental expansion potential, positioning the campus to support 750 MW of gross HPC leasing capacity"
