L000108330126000162_terawulfq22026investorpr,mw_it,6.0,MW,,it,"LAKE MARINER LEASE AMENDMENTS RESULT IN +$500M IN REVENUE OVER TERM Executed on July 5th, 2026: WULF Contributing ~$150 Million to Fund Tenant Fit -Out Costs Incurred Through June 30, 2026 (1) FINANCIALS Date Shift Rent Shift CB - 3 Q2’26 Monthly TFO Rent Increase Q2 - Q3’26 +~$60MM Revenue (Over 10 - Year Lease) CB - 4 Q3’26 +6 MW of Critical IT & Monthly TFO Rent Increase Q3 – Q4’26 +~$220MM Revenue (Over 10 - Year Lease) CB - 5 Q4’26 +6 MW of Critical IT & Monthly TFO Rent Increase Q1’27 +~$225MM Revenue (Over 10 - Year Lease) • Customer - approved schedule shifts for tenant design & fit - out • No schedule delay penalties to WULF • Rent shift reflects tenant - requested fit - out costs, rentalized over the lease term • Incremental critical IT reflects capacity change from Feb 2026 (1) Any Tenant Fit-Out incurred after July 5, 2026, is paid by the tenant in cash plus a modest margin as outlined in the amendments. 14"
