L000110465924074337_tm2417925d1_ex99-2,tenant,IBM,,,,"India is ranked as the second highest in terms of businesses adopting AI technologies, according to IBM's Enterprise AI Adoption Survey5 • Data center capacity is expected to continue growing at an accelerated rate due to the following factors: ‒ Growing mobile data usage, increased adoption of cloud computing, emerging requirements for data localization, and growing IoT adoption ‒ Data center availability per capita in India is considerably lower than Western counterparts"
