L000110465925023907_dnn-20241231xex99d2,usd_other,16.0,$M,approximately,,"In January 2024, Denison awarded a contract for approximately $16 million to Wood Canada Limited (‘Wood’), for the completion of detailed design engineering for the Phoenix ISR project"
