L000110465925023907_dnn-20241231xex99d2,rfs,1,flag,,,"KLP ($1.7 million): Evaluation efforts, which commenced in September 2024 and are continuing into 2025, include metallurgical test work, engineering design work, trade-off studies, and economic analyses"
L000110465925023907_dnn-20241231xex99d2,usd_other,76.6,$M,,,The 2025 Outlook includes $76.6 million for the continuation of procurement of equipment and facilities needed to maintain the project execution schedule
