L000110465925078084_tm2523008d2_ex99-2,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,Fluidstack is a high - performance cloud platform designed for the world’s most ambitious technology companies
L000110465925078084_tm2523008d2_ex99-2,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,"Founded in 2017 at Oxford University, Fluidstack powers leading innovators such as Moonvalley , Character.AI, Poolside, and Black Forest Labs"
