L000110465925102858_tm2529509d1_8k,tenant,Fluidstack,,,,"In addition, in connection with the ground lease for the Abernathy HPC Campus (the “Abernathy Ground Lease”), FS AB entered into recognition agreements with Google and Fluidstack, respectively, and the landlord under the Abernathy Ground Lease, pursuant to which Google and Fluidstack have certain rights and obligations with respect to the Abernathy Ground Lease in the event of certain defaults under the Abernathy Ground Lease"
L000110465925102858_tm2529509d1_8k,tenant,Google,,,,"In addition, in connection with the ground lease for the Abernathy HPC Campus (the “Abernathy Ground Lease”), FS AB entered into recognition agreements with Google and Fluidstack, respectively, and the landlord under the Abernathy Ground Lease, pursuant to which Google and Fluidstack have certain rights and obligations with respect to the Abernathy Ground Lease in the event of certain defaults under the Abernathy Ground Lease"
