L000110465925104461_riot-20251030xex99d2,usd_other,3.0,$M,,,"APPENDIX Q3 OPERATIONAL DATA . . . . . . 22.0 EH/s 31.5 EH/s 33.7 EH/s 35.4 EH/s 36.5 EH/s 66% 83% 88% 87% 86% 30% 40% 50% 60% 70% 80% 90% 100% 110% 120% -$3 m $2 m $7 m $12 m $17 m $22 m $27 m $32 m $37 m $42 m Q3 2024 Q4 2024 Q1 2025 Q2 2025 Q3 2025 Ending hash rate capacity Hash Rate Utilization (%) $67.5 $126.3 $142.9 $140.9 $160.8 42% 50% 53% 50% 59% 0% 50% 100% 150% 200% $0 m $20 m $40 m $60 m $80 m $100 m $120 m $140 m $160 m $180 m Q3 2024 Q4 2024 Q1 2025 Q2 2025 Q3 2025 Bitcoin Mining Revenue ($ million) Gross Margin (%) Bitcoin Mining – Increasing Efficiency and Scale of Operations 25 ▪ Q3 2025 Revenue of $160.8m and Gross Margin of 59%, highest revenue and gross margin for the Bitcoin Mining business in the past five quarters ▪ Bitcoin Mining gross margins significantly increased in Q3 2025, driven by Riot’s power strategy, strong hash rate utilization, and increase in average hash price ▪ Q3 2025 Cost to Mine of $46,324, a 6% decrease compared to Q2 2025 due to Riot’s power strategy driving an all-in cost of power of 3.2c/kWh ▪ Strong hash rate utilization averaging 86% in Q3 2025, a significant increase year over year from 66% in Q3 2024 1"
