L000110465926019393_hut-20260225xex99d1,mw_unspecified,310.0,MW,,unspecified,"- Refined portfolio structure and streamlined capital allocation framework through the sale of a 310 MW portfolio of four natural gas-fired power plants, which closed in February 2026, and the launch and public listing of American Bitcoin Corp., a majority-owned Bitcoin accumulation subsidiary"
