L000110465926055894_hut-20260506xex99d1,mw_unspecified,310.0,MW,,unspecified,"- Simplified and strengthened the balance sheet through the divestiture of the Company’s 310 MW portfolio of natural gas power plants and, subsequent to quarter-end, the refinancing of the Company’s Bitcoin-backed credit facility, reducing cost of debt from 9.0% to 7.0%, unencumbering approximately 3,300 BTC, and releasing balance sheet liquidity to fund growth"
