L000110465926084862_tm2620835d1_ex99-1,mw_it,352.0,MW,,it,"(Nasdaq, TSX: HUT) (“Hut 8” or the “Company”), an energy infrastructure platform integrating power, digital infrastructure, and compute at scale to fuel next-generation, energy-intensive technologies, today announced the commercialization of the second phase of its one-gigawatt Beacon Point data center campus in Nueces County, Texas through a second 15-year, $9.8 billion lease (the “Agreement”) for 352 megawatts (MW) of IT capacity (the “Transaction”)"
