L000110465926091832_tm2622039d1_6k,rfs,1,flag,,,"Transition businesses fully on track to meet or exceed annual profitability and growth targets . · Enilive and Plenitude delivered adjusted EBITDA of €1.1 billion in the first half ’26. . · Activities are progressing for the deconsolidation of Plenitude in 3Q ’26, with Eni still retaining a 65% stake, thus providing the entity with a more efficient capital structure to pursue growth plans. . · Enilive signed an agreement to acquire from Prax a network of 320 service stations branded OIL!, strengthening its presence in the mobility retail business in key European markets. . · Secured financing for the CCUS business from a pool of international lenders"
