L000110465926093406_riot-20260810xex99d1,mw_it,191.0,MW,,it,"Subsequent to quarter end, Riot announced the execution of a Data Center Lease and Services Agreement (the “Data Center Lease”) with one of the world’s leading frontier AI labs, for 191 MW of critical IT capacity at Riot’s Rockdale campus"
