L000114036124032462_ef20032143_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,570.0,MW,,unspecified,"Management Commentary. . “In June, Bitdeer made substantial progress in advancing our strategic initiatives in Bitcoin mining and HPC and AI,” stated Linghui Kong, Chief Business Officer of Bitdeer. “We entered into a 30-year lease agreement with Monroe County Port Authority for 570 MW of ready-to-use power infrastructure"
L000114036124032462_ef20032143_ex99-1,term_years,30.0,years,,,"Management Commentary. . “In June, Bitdeer made substantial progress in advancing our strategic initiatives in Bitcoin mining and HPC and AI,” stated Linghui Kong, Chief Business Officer of Bitdeer. “We entered into a 30-year lease agreement with Monroe County Port Authority for 570 MW of ready-to-use power infrastructure"
L000114036124032462_ef20032143_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"This deal increases our total global contracted power capacity to 2.5 GW, positioning us with one of the industry’s largest power development platforms"
L000114036124032462_ef20032143_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"Kong added, “In June, we also successfully energized the first batch of Sealminers into our datacenters and began rigorous testing"
