L000114036124036828_ef20033833_ex99-1,usd_other,228.8,$M,,,"Kong added, “Finally, we ended the quarter in a strong financial position with $228.8 million of cash and cash equivalents and cryptocurrencies on hand"
L000114036124036828_ef20033833_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"As we gear up for the upcoming bull market, we remain focused on expanding our Bitcoin self-mining capacity, executing our SEALMINER technology roadmap, and monetizing our impressive 2.5 GW power portfolio for HPC/AI.”"
