L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"For SEALMINER A1, the first sample batch was successfully energized and production of 3.7 EH/s is expected to be completed and installed into our datacenters in Texas and Norway in phases from December through Q1 2025 for the time being"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"Further, in October, we commenced mass production of our SEALMINER A2 series and the first production run is expected to deliver 18 EH/s, which will be used for self-mining and selling to external customers"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"Kong continued, “In our Cloud HPC and AI business, our NVIDIA DGX SuperPOD system at our datacenter in Singapore successfully achieved approximately 98% utilization in September, and we expanded a pilot program in Canada"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"Additionally, we’re actively exploring ways to leverage our substantial 2.5 GW power capacity across three continents to meet the growing demand from HPC and AI datacenters"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,We have commenced discussions with potential partners and end users for these sites and are actively collaborating with leading data center developers and advisors to secure long-term partnerships and strategic opportunities that can position Bitdeer to play a pivotal role in the rapidly evolving HPC and AI ecosystem
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,1100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Finally, our global infrastructure expansion continues to progress, with projects in Norway, Ohio, and Texas, and Bhutan set to bring online over an estimated 1.1 GW of new power capacity in the coming year.”"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"First, the conversion of 100 MW of hosting capacity at our Texas facility to hydro-cooling, which is expected to be fully renovated and equipped with SEALMINER hydro-cooled mining rigs for our self-mining by the first quarter of 2025"
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,usd_other,291.3,$M,,,We ended the quarter in a strong financial position with $291.3 million in cash and cash equivalents
L000114036124047159_ef20038562_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"In summary, we are on the verge of achieving many exciting milestones, and we remain committed on continuing to execute the SEALMINER roadmap, expanding our self-mining hash rate, and leveraging our industry-leading global 2.5 GW power portfolio.”"
