L000114036125013247_ef20046998_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"Management Commentary. . . “We achieved significant operational progress in March,” stated Matt Kong, Chief Business Officer at Bitdeer. “First, we completed mass production of 3.8 EH/s our SEALMINER A1 mining rigs and energized 2.8 EH/s, increasing our self-mining hashrate to 11.5 EH/s at the end of March with the remaining to be installed and turned on in April"
L000114036125013247_ef20046998_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,600.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"Finally, we obtained regulatory approval for Phase 1 and 2 of our Tydal, Norway site and we expect to energize more than 600 MW of power capacity over the next few months, including our Bhutan site.”"
