L000114036125037969_ef20056907_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Core Scientific is Closely Linked to CoreWeave Today CoreWeave is Core Scientific’s main colocation customer today and represents the vast majority of its total consolidated revenue in 2026E Revenue Detail $96.9 $698.7 $290.5 $2.0 $177.0 $41.1 $389.4 $916.7 2025E 2026E BTC Mining & Hosting Management Standalone Revenue Projections 2025E Colocation Revenue Mix 2026E Colocation Revenue Mix CoreWeave-Related Revenues: 98% CoreWeave-Related Revenues: 95% $698.7 $41.1 $96.9 $2.0 Pipeline Pipeline By 2026E, CoreWeave-related revenue is projected to constitute ~95% of Core Scientific’s Colocation revenue and ~76% of its total projected revenue as Core Scientific shifts its business away from BTC mining and hosting and toward colocation CoreWeave- Related ~25% CoreWeave- Related ~76% 1 6 Source: Core Scientific Management Financial Projections (as of 06/18/2025)"
