L000114036125038207_ef20057150_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Investors and security holders may obtain free copies of the registration statement and the proxy statement/prospectus, as well as other filings containing important information about Core Scientific or CoreWeave, without charge at the SEC’s Internet website (http://www.sec.gov)"
