L000114487924000191_apld-20240719,credit_support,1,flag,,,"We cannot, however, guarantee that the conflicts of interest described above, or other future conflicts of interest, will not manifest in advice or decisions that negatively impact our financial results and our operations"
L000114487924000191_apld-20240719,credit_support,1,flag,,,"There can be no assurance that our deposits in excess of the FDIC or other comparable insurance limits will be backstopped by the U.S., or that any bank or . 20 . . . . . . financial institution with which we do business will be able to obtain needed liquidity from other banks, government institutions or by acquisition in the event of a failure or liquidity crisis"
