L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_it,200.0,MW,,it,This lease represents approximately $5 billion in total contracted revenue over an estimated 15-year lease term and covers 200 megawatts (MW) of critical IT load purpose-built to support the Hyperscaler’s artificial intelligence (AI) and high-performance compute (HPC) infrastructure
