L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_it,800.0,MW,,it,"The Hyperscaler also holds a first right of refusal for an additional 800 MW of critical IT, representing the full expansion potential of the 1-gigawatt (GW) Polaris Forge 2 Campus"
