L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_unspecified,600.0,MW,,unspecified,"With this agreement, Applied Digital’s total leased capacity with two of the world’s largest hyperscalers across its Polaris Forge 1 and Polaris Forge 2 campuses in North Dakota has now reached 600 MW, reinforcing the company’s position as one of the fastest-scaling builders of AI infrastructure in the United States. . “What sets us apart isn’t just the size of our pipeline - it’s how fast we can deliver,"" said Wes Cummins, Chairman and CEO of Applied Digital. “The real constraint in this industry is execution, and our team continues to prove that large-scale, next-generation data centers can be designed, financed, and brought online faster and more efficiently than anyone thought possible"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_unspecified,200.0,MW,,unspecified,"The initial 200 MW are phased within two buildings expected to begin to come online in 2026 and reach a total of 200 MW in 2027, with the campus being designed for future expansion"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_unspecified,200.0,MW,,unspecified,"The initial 200 MW are phased within two buildings expected to begin to come online in 2026 and reach a total of 200 MW in 2027, with the campus being designed for future expansion"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,mw_unspecified,150.0,MW,,unspecified,"This announcement follows a period of record-breaking growth and notable achievements for Applied Digital, including an additional 150MW lease with CoreWeave at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus, a $5.0 billion AI infrastructure partnership with Macquarie Asset Management , and several industry and community impact recognitions"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,usd_other,5000.0,$M,,,"This announcement follows a period of record-breaking growth and notable achievements for Applied Digital, including an additional 150MW lease with CoreWeave at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus, a $5.0 billion AI infrastructure partnership with Macquarie Asset Management , and several industry and community impact recognitions"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"This announcement follows a period of record-breaking growth and notable achievements for Applied Digital, including an additional 150MW lease with CoreWeave at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus, a $5.0 billion AI infrastructure partnership with Macquarie Asset Management , and several industry and community impact recognitions"
L000114487925000076_ad-harwood_prxfinal102225,rfs,1,flag,,,"We believe these accomplishments, coupled with this announcement, reinforce Applied Digital’s momentum and underscore its position at the forefront of the AI and data center industries. . “Our AI Factories are redefining how and where hyperscale infrastructure gets built,” Cummins added. “We’re demonstrating that the next chapter of AI computing can be powered from the heartland - built responsibly, delivered quickly and designed for the Intelligence Era.”"
