L000114487926000029_apldq326earningsrelease,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Over two years ago, we were among the first to recognize the surging demand and broke ground on our first 100 MW facility"
L000114487926000029_apldq326earningsrelease,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"That early investment is now paying off. . “We now operate one of the only 100 MW direct-to-chip liquid-cooled data centers online today, and more importantly, it is fully operational"
