L000114487926000029_apldq326earningsrelease,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"That initial 100 MW represents approximately one-sixth of our contracted capacity and one-tenth of what is operating or under construction, but we believe it begins to show what's possible from here as we continue to bring additional capacity online in the coming quarters,” said Wes Cummins, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer"
