L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Operations commenced at average throughput of 71 t/d Mason and White (1986) . 1951 Theresa Gold Mines Underground development continued
L000117184326002005_exh_991,tenant,Meta,,,,"The Viper Property is located within the Beardmore–Geraldton Greenstone Belt at the junction of the Central Meta Volcanic Unit and the Southern Meta Sedimentary Unit, an area characterized by intense deformation"
L000117184326002005_exh_991,tenant,Meta,,,,The Central Meta Volcanic Unit is dominated by massive and pillowed basaltic to andesitic flows that show geochemical features typical of mid ocean ridge basalts
L000117184326002005_exh_991,tenant,Meta,,,,The Southern Meta Sedimentary Unit comprises both clastic and chemical sedimentary rocks
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,"At the end of each shift, the core is delivered to the core shack"
L000117184326002005_exh_991,term_years,5.0,years,,,"A diamond drilling campaign commenced in May 2025 targeting geologic and structural features throughout the planned Greenstone pit, with emphasis on the near-term (5 year) mining"
