L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,"This variance is considered acceptable at this stage, as the Mine has only recently commenced operations and a significant proportion of the mined ore has not yet been processed (currently in stockpile).. . 14.1.9.7 Discussion on Block Model Validation"
