L000117184326002005_exh_991,term_years,18.0,years,,,"There has been significant past production at the Kailey deposit, formerly known as the Little Long Lac Mine, which produced 1.78 Mt at an average grade of 10.6 g/t Au for 607 koz over an 18-year mine life"
