L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Plant construction commenced in Q4 2021 and was substantially complete at the end of Q4 2023
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Commissioning activities commenced in Q1 2024 and continued through Q3 2024
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Sodium hydroxide (NaOH), also known as caustic soda, is used as a pH modifier and supplied in liquid form at 50% concentration and delivered by 20 tonne bulk tanker trucks"
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Flocculant is delivered by road to site, offloaded by forklift, and stored in the reagent storage area adjacent to the reagents mixing facility"
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Hydrochloric acid is delivered by 22-tonne bulk tanker trucks as a 33% concentrated solution and stored in the hydrochloric acid storage tank and then pumped to the acid wash column.. . 17.3.1.6 Copper Sulphate (CuSO 4 ·5H 2 O)
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Liquid sulphur dioxide is delivered by a 30-tonne bulk tanker-truck and stored in two 80 tonne-capacity pressure-vessel storage tanks equipped with a padding air system to maintain the sulphur dioxide in liquid form
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Antiscalant is delivered in a liquid form in 1 m 3 ISO containers
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,Relocation of historical MacLeod tailings commenced in January 2024 and is ongoing
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,"As of year-end 2025, a total of 11.5 Mt of mill tailings and 3.9 Mt of historical tailings have been deposited, with an additional 179.3 Mt of mill tailings and 2.3 Mt of historical tailings to be delivered to the TMF over the remaining LOM"
L000117184326002005_exh_991,rfs,1,flag,,,The design of the seepage collection systems for WRSA-D's southern (Phase 2) expansion and for the future WRSA-F is anticipated to commence in 2026
