L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,mw_unspecified,85.0,MW,up to,unspecified,"Based on the up to 85 MW of guaranteed take-or-pay capacity, the Company estimates that the potential aggregate lease revenue, assuming terms consistent with the LOI, could be approximately $2.8 billion over the initial 15-year lease term (or approximately $5.4 billion if the offtaker exercises both of its five-year renewal options, for a total term of 25 years), assuming that the lease agreement is executed on the terms currently contemplated, full performance, and no early termination"
