L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,mw_it,300.0,MW,,it,"In parallel, the Company is advancing the planned expansion of its Niagara Falls campus by entering into an exclusivity agreement with a landowner covering certain parcels of sufficient size and characteristics to support the full scope of the Company’s contemplated campus expansion, including the development of in excess of 300 MW of total critical IT capacity over time, and is in advanced negotiations toward a definitive purchase and sale agreement for those parcels"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,fitout,1,flag,,,"These arrangements intend to support the capitalization of Pubco at closing, as well as the Company’s initial build-out costs"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,financing_or_capex,175.0,$M,,,Such anticipated financing transactions include a private placement of $175 million in aggregate principal amount of convertible senior notes (“Convertible Notes”)
L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"Blockfusion and Blue believe that the developments described herein reinforce the investment thesis underlying the proposed Business Combination, highlighting Blockfusion’s line of sight to securing long-term contracted demand, executing on a scalable development pipeline and delivering a capital-efficient path to growth:. . ● Long-term contracted revenue visibility expected to be anchored by take-or-pay commitments from a leading AI counterparty . . ● Access to scarce, low-cost, low-carbon power capacity, a key competitive advantage in an increasingly constrained AI infrastructure market . . ● Scaled, expansion-ready campus anchored by strategic, energized land , enabling platform-level growth . . ● Institutional capital support and enhanced closing certainty through structured financing and non-redemption agreements . . ● Positioning as a pure-play AI infrastructure platform at the intersection of power, compute and data center scarcity . . . 3"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,fitout,1,flag,,,"the availability, allocation of additional power and receipt of necessary permits related to the Niagara Falls campus and the Company’s expansion and build-out plans"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-1,usd_other,19100.0,$M,,,"As of June 2026, Sona manages c.$19.1bn AUM on behalf of institutional investors, with a team of more than 170 people across London, New York, Abu Dhabi, Hong Kong and Tokyo"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-2,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"Blockfusion is a rare combination of existing and operational 50 MW site with a proprietary pipeline of vetted sites across the US, as well as a non-binding Letter of Intent for up to 300 MW of IT load capacity"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-2,mw_it,300.0,MW,up to,it,"Blockfusion is a rare combination of existing and operational 50 MW site with a proprietary pipeline of vetted sites across the US, as well as a non-binding Letter of Intent for up to 300 MW of IT load capacity"
L000118518526002723_baccex99-2,mw_unspecified,85.0,MW,,unspecified,"Based on current assumptions regarding the 85 MW take-or-pay capacity reflected in the LOI, the Company estimates that potential aggregate lease revenue from the offtaker tenant could be as much as approximately $2.8 billion over the initial 15-year lease term, subject to execution of definitive lease agreements on currently contemplated terms and satisfaction of applicable conditions precedent"
