L000118518526002723_baccex99-2,usd_other,5400.0,$M,approximately,,"The projected revenue for Phase 1, based on current assumptions and subject to execution of definitive lease agreements, is approximately $2.8 billion, and assuming all renewal options are exercised, as much as approximately $5.4 billion"
