L000118518526002723_baccex99-2,financing_or_capex,175.0,$M,,,"The non-binding Term Sheet Blockfusion entered into with Sona contemplates the issuance of $175M in convertible notes at a premium and without any resets, as well as a $33M Non-Redemption Agreement (NRA) with Blue, which, if consummated, would together provide a significant portion of the capital anticipated to be needed to execute the critically important initial elements of our business plan"
