L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,CoreWeave to Acquire Core Scientific
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Livingston, NJ and Austin, TX – July 7, 2025 – CoreWeave (NASDAQ: CRWV), the AI Hyperscaler ™ , and Core Scientific (NASDAQ: CORZ), a leading data center infrastructure provider, today announced that they have signed a definitive agreement under which CoreWeave will acquire Core Scientific in an all-stock transaction"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,Hyperscaler,,,,"Livingston, NJ and Austin, TX – July 7, 2025 – CoreWeave (NASDAQ: CRWV), the AI Hyperscaler ™ , and Core Scientific (NASDAQ: CORZ), a leading data center infrastructure provider, today announced that they have signed a definitive agreement under which CoreWeave will acquire Core Scientific in an all-stock transaction"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Under the terms of the merger agreement, Core Scientific stockholders will receive 0.1235 newly issued shares of CoreWeave Class A common stock for each share of Core Scientific common stock based on a fixed exchange ratio"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Following CoreWeave’s successful IPO in March 2025, this acquisition will help CoreWeave verticalize its data center footprint to future-proof revenue growth and enhance profitability"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,mw_gross,1300.0,MW,approximately,gross,"Through this acquisition, CoreWeave will own approximately 1.3 GW of gross power across Core Scientific’s national data center footprint 1 with an incremental 1 GW+ of potential gross power available for expansion. . “This acquisition accelerates our strategy to deploy AI and HPC workloads at scale,” said Michael Intrator, CoreWeave’s Chief Executive Officer, Chairman of the Board, and co-founder. “Verticalizing the ownership of Core Scientific’s high-performance data center infrastructure enables CoreWeave to significantly enhance operating efficiency and de-risk our future expansion, solidifying our growth trajectory"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,mw_gross,1000.0,MW,,gross,"Through this acquisition, CoreWeave will own approximately 1.3 GW of gross power across Core Scientific’s national data center footprint 1 with an incremental 1 GW+ of potential gross power available for expansion. . “This acquisition accelerates our strategy to deploy AI and HPC workloads at scale,” said Michael Intrator, CoreWeave’s Chief Executive Officer, Chairman of the Board, and co-founder. “Verticalizing the ownership of Core Scientific’s high-performance data center infrastructure enables CoreWeave to significantly enhance operating efficiency and de-risk our future expansion, solidifying our growth trajectory"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Through this acquisition, CoreWeave will own approximately 1.3 GW of gross power across Core Scientific’s national data center footprint 1 with an incremental 1 GW+ of potential gross power available for expansion. . “This acquisition accelerates our strategy to deploy AI and HPC workloads at scale,” said Michael Intrator, CoreWeave’s Chief Executive Officer, Chairman of the Board, and co-founder. “Verticalizing the ownership of Core Scientific’s high-performance data center infrastructure enables CoreWeave to significantly enhance operating efficiency and de-risk our future expansion, solidifying our growth trajectory"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,Strategic Benefits of CoreWeave’s Acquisition
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,• Operational Efficiency: CoreWeave expects to generate significant cost savings through streamlining business operations and eliminating lease overhead
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"• Greater Financing Flexibility: CoreWeave can pursue infrastructure financing strategies to finance committed capital expenditures, reducing its overall cost of capital"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,• Power Ownership and Optionality: CoreWeave will gain greater control over a critical power footprint and optionality for future power capacity
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"• Expanded Expertise: Core Scientific’s data center development capabilities complement and augment CoreWeave’s extensive expertise in power procurement, construction, and site management for infrastructure assets. . . “As our longstanding partner, CoreWeave has experienced firsthand the operational excellence we deliver and the value of the services we provide,” said Adam Sullivan, President and Chief Executive Officer of Core Scientific. “Together with CoreWeave, we will be well-positioned to accelerate the availability of world-class infrastructure for companies innovating with AI while delivering the greatest value for our shareholders, who will be able to participate in the tremendous upside potential of the combined company.”"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Upon closing and under the terms of the agreement, which has been approved by the board of directors of each company, Core Scientific stockholders will receive 0.1235 newly issued shares of CoreWeave Class A common stock for each share of Core Scientific common stock held"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,contract_value,9000.0,$M,approximately,,"As of July 3, 2025, the agreed-upon exchange ratio implies a total equity value of approximately $9.0 billion"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,This is calculated on a fully diluted basis and based on CoreWeave’s 5-day VWAP
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"This represents a $20.40 per share value based on the closing price of CoreWeave Class A common stock as of July 3, 2025, and a premium of approximately 66% to the unaffected Core Scientific closing share price of $12.30 on June 25, 2025"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Upon close, CoreWeave expects Core Scientific’s stockholders’ ownership of the combined company will be less than 10%"
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,usd_other,10000.0,$M,over,,• Immediate elimination of over $10 billion of cumulative future lease overhead to be paid for existing contractual sites over the next 12 years
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,(1) Represents ~840 existing gross MW power supporting CoreWeave’s HPC contracts and ~500 gross MW crypto mining data center power capacity
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,• Leverage neutral impact to CoreWeave while opening access to diverse financing sources at a more attractive cost of capital
L000119312525155925_d52423dex991,annual_revenue,500.0,$M,,,"• Including the elimination of the lease overhead, this deal adds $500 million of estimated fully ramped, annual run rate cost savings by the end of 2027 through streamlined operational focus"
