L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,Bell AI Fabric Expands National Network with 300 MW Data Centre in Saskatchewan
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"REGINA, March 16, 2026 – Bell Canada and the Government of Saskatchewan today announced a transformational step forward for Bell AI Fabric and for Canada’s AI future: a new 300 MW data centre in the Rural Municipality of Sherwood, Saskatchewan, just outside of Regina"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,financing_or_capex,12000.0,$M,up to,,"Over time, the facility is projected to generate economic value of up to $12 billion for the province, including short- and long-term job creation, tax revenues and broader economic benefits"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,credit_support,1,flag,,,"Importantly, a significant portion of the facility’s power will be dedicated to sovereign AI compute, ensuring that government agencies, researchers and enterprises in Canada can access top-tier AI power while guaranteeing their data remains within Canada, meeting strict chain-of-custody and residency requirements"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,Cerebras and CoreWeave are secured as the tenants for the new facility
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"CoreWeave will deliver cutting-edge, scalable AI compute hosted on NVIDIA GPUs"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"CoreWeave will deliver cutting-edge, scalable AI compute hosted on NVIDIA GPUs"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"- Sachin Jain, Chief Operating Officer, CoreWeave . . “On behalf of George Gordon Developments, the business arm of George Gordon First Nation, we are excited to partner with Bell AI Fabric on this major economic project"
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,usd_other,1500.0,$M,approximately,,BCE is also increasing its objective for AI-powered solutions revenue 2 from approximately $1.5 billion by 2028 to approximately $2.0 billion by 2028
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,usd_other,2000.0,$M,approximately,,BCE is also increasing its objective for AI-powered solutions revenue 2 from approximately $1.5 billion by 2028 to approximately $2.0 billion by 2028
L000119312526109399_d46621dex991,financing_or_capex,1700.0,$M,approximately,,"The construction of this facility will require approximately $1.7 billion of incremental capital expenditures, with approximately $1.3 billion expected to be incurred in 2026, funded through a combination of debt and cash-on-hand"
