L000119312526165121_d149019dex992,mw_unspecified,65.0,MW,,unspecified,"The Marble Campus sits on land owned by Core Scientific Marble, consists of approximately 73 acres and will feature a 65 MW data center, and construction involves converting the Property from cryptocurrency mining to HPC and AI workloads"
