L000119312526165121_d149019dex992,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"In exchange for the foregoing, CoreWeave will receive a credit (“End of Term Credit”) against its base license fee equal to (x) $217,163 per MW with respect to the Denton, Dalton 1, and Dalton 4 Campuses and (y) $228,413 with respect to the Muskogee and Marble Campuses"
L000119312526165121_d149019dex992,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"The End of Term Credit is applied during the last two (2) months of the term of the applicable CoreWeave License Agreement, and if not exhausted, any remaining amount is remitted to CoreWeave"
L000119312526165121_d149019dex992,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Except under the Austin Colocation License Agreement, CoreWeave is also responsible for providing the Contributed Assets at its cost and expense"
