L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,118.0,$M,,,"The results indicate that at a gold price of US$2,750/oz, the after tax NPV @ 5% is US$118 million"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,term_years,3.0,years,,,"Financial assurance bonding for reclamation is in place and current, with the next required three-year bond review anticipated in 2028 to 2029"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,8.64,$M,,,"The current reclamation cost estimate, prepared using Nevada’s standardized cost model, is US$8.64 million; this figure reflects a government-administered closure scenario and is expected to differ from the cost the operator would actually incur, and from the eventual cost at the 2032 anticipated closure date, as site conditions evolve"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,16.0,$M,,,The proposed work program has an estimated cost of US$16 million based on current conditions
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,118.0,$M,,,"The results indicate that at a gold price of US$2,750/oz the after-tax NPV @ 5% is US$118 million"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,8.64,$M,,,"Beyond this, the project carries a standard reclamation and closure bonding obligation, currently estimated at US$8.64 million under Nevada’s standardized cost model, which will be revised at the next required three-year bond review (2028 to 2029) and is likely to differ from the operator’s actual future closure cost given expected changes in site conditions before the 2032 anticipated closure date"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,term_years,3.0,years,,,"Beyond this, the project carries a standard reclamation and closure bonding obligation, currently estimated at US$8.64 million under Nevada’s standardized cost model, which will be revised at the next required three-year bond review (2028 to 2029) and is likely to differ from the operator’s actual future closure cost given expected changes in site conditions before the 2032 anticipated closure date"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,12.0,$M,approximately,,"Homestake and Barrick, having become 50/50 partners in PMC, conducted an exploration program from 1996 to 2000, expending approximately US$12 million exploring the deeper feeder fault zones of the Property for a large, high-grade gold system"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,12.0,$M,,,"Atna Resources Ltd. acquired an option in August 2004 to earn a 70% joint venture interest in the Property from PMC, completing its earn-in in 2006 after expending the required US$12 million"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,30.0,$M,over,,"PMC elected to back-in for an additional 40% interest in April 2006 and spent over US$30 million on surface and underground diamond core and RC drilling, underground drifting, and surface infrastructure (including rapid infiltration basins, a mineralized material stockpile pad, and underground electrical upgrades) before completing its claw-back in early 2009, at which point PMC held 70% and Atna 30% of the joint venture"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Underground development commenced in early 2012, and mine ramp-up began in late 2012; a total of 1,832 m (6,011 ft) of primary and secondary development was completed during 2012 and 2013, and approximately 27,216 t (30,000 st) of ore containing 7,900 oz of gold were mined and shipped to off-site processing facilities"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Hydrogeological data — water table measurements, pore pressure distribution, and groundwater flow direction — are collected in conjunction with exploration and geotechnical investigations, supplemented once mining commenced by in-pit and underground operational data"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Core is transferred from the core barrel to a wax-impregnated box at the drill rig, washed, and delivered to i-80 Gold’s Lone Tree core shed for logging and sampling"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Figure 8-3: Historical Combined Duplicate Scatter, 2005 to 2018 . i-80 Gold Corp acquired the Granite Creek Property in 2021 and commenced drilling in April 2021"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Prior to logging, core is washed and scrubbed to remove drill fluids and mud, so geological textures can be clearly observed, with core boxes oriented in ascending order and box labels verified for accuracy before logging commences"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"As part of the toll milling process, bench top autoclave tests are conducted at the on-site laboratory of the third-party toll milling facility that currently processes Granite Creek Underground production, on a composite of each monthly delivery lot, to assign a gold recovery value to that lot’s production; the result is used, together with the results from other feed components delivered that month, to reconcile the plant’s actual gold recovery to each individual component"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"Gold grades of the delivered samples ranged from 5.34 to 21.8 g/t, with composite samples displaying a consistent gold grade around 15 g/t; gold cyanide analysis showed three samples (SPZM, SPZN, and SPZCOM2) were highly refractory (AuCN less than 10% of total gold) while three others (SPZS, SPZHG, and SPZCOM3) displayed partial free gold or weak refractoriness"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"The drill hole data for the Granite Creek Mine Project was delivered as separate .csv files that contained exploration and production collar locations, drillhole survey orientations, sample intervals with gold assays in ppm, geologic intervals with lithology, alteration type, and alteration strength"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,• Installed motor power should be delivered at 480V
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,Intake airflow is delivered through a series of raises that were developed through the center of the spirals on the decline
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,contract_value,1.25,$M,,,A total estimated cost of US$1.25 million for injection grouting was added to the raisebore excavation based upon previous WSP projects of similar scope
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,15.9,$M,,,These items are estimated to have a capital cost of US$15.9 million
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,term_years,3.0,years,,,"Granite Creek has an 8.3-year projected mine life, from 2026 to 2034"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,Mining commenced at Lone Tree in April 1991 with the first gold pour in August 1991
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,ROM ore will be delivered to the ore stockpile area
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"The oxygen plant is mandated to supply up to 200 stpd of gaseous oxygen at 375 psi(g), delivered to the autoclave, and at reduced pressure to the neutralization tanks, CIL tanks, and cyanide destruction tanks for plant uses"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,usd_other,5.7,$M,,,"The cost to complete infrastructure construction as of June 1, 2026, is US$5.7 million. . . 15.2 Access and Local Resources"
