L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,"• Mass of material will be determined by net truck weights of material delivered and moisture content determined by sampling, monthly"
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,• Silver production credit will be allocated quarterly based on the silver produced and the delivered mass and grade of material from Granite Creek during that quarter
L000119312526397337_d29391dex991,rfs,1,flag,,,There are no plans at present to commence construction of a decline originating in the southwest highwall on the 4700 bench of the Mag Pit
