L000121390024085107_ea021672901ex99-1_bitfarms,contract_value,10.5,$M,,,"September 2024 Financial Update . . ● Sold 173 of the 217 BTC earned as part of the Company’s regular treasury management practice for total proceeds of $10.5 million. . . ● Total liquidity of $146 million, including $73 million in cash at September 30, 2024. . . ● Added 44 BTC, bringing Treasury to 1,147 BTC, up from 1,103 BTC last month and representing $73.4 million based on a BTC price of $64,000 at September 30, 2024. . . ● Synthetic HODL™ of 602 long-dated BTC call options at September 30, 2024. . . ● The employment dispute with the former CEO has been settled"
