L000121390024088517_ea0217827-6k_bitdigital,mw_unspecified,4.0,MW,,unspecified,"This transaction vertically integrates Bit Digital’s HPC operations with an existing, fully operational and fully leased 4MW Tier-3 datacenter headquartered in Montreal, Canada"
