L000121390024097122_ea022036001ex99-2_bitfarms,contract_value,72.6,$M,approximately,,"Operations . ● Increased Hashrate from 10.4 EH/s at June 30, 2024 to 11.3 EH/s at September 30, 2024, an increase of 9%, through the energization of approximately 5,400 more efficient Miners; . ● Earned 703 BTC at an average direct cost of $36,000 per BTC 2 or an average total cash cost of $52,400 per BTC 2 and held 1,147 BTC valued at approximately $72.6 million as of September 30, 2024; and . ● Sold 461 BTC at an average price of $60,600 per BTC for total proceeds of $27.9 million, a portion of which was used to pay capital expenditures"
