L000121390025042951_ea024165501ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,Gross Mining profit Gross Profit adjusted to exclude: (i) non-Mining revenues; (ii) depreciation and amortization; (iii) purchase of electrical components and other expenses; (iv) electrician salaries and payroll taxes; and (v) sales tax recovery. ● To assess profitability after power costs in cryptocurrency production and other infrastructure costs
L000121390025042951_ea024165501ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,Power costs are the largest variable expense in Mining. . ● To provide the users of the MD&A the ability to assess the gross profitability of the Company’s digital asset Mining operations
L000121390025042951_ea024165501ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,"Gross Mining margin The percentage obtained when dividing Gross Mining profit by Mining related revenues. ● To assess profitability after power costs in cryptocurrency production, the largest variable expense in Mining. . ● To provide the users of the MD&A the ability to assess the profitability of the Company’s core digital asset Mining operations, exclusive of depreciation and amortization and certain general and administrative expenses"
L000121390025042951_ea024165501ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,"Direct Cost per BTC The amount obtained when dividing Direct Cost by the quantity of BTC earned. ● To assess the Company’s power costs, the largest variable expense in Mining. . ● To provide the users of the MD&A a metric to evaluate the Company’s direct variable cost for its core digital asset Mining operations across time periods. . ● Used by Management to assess the operating performance from period to period and to prepare annual operating budgets and forecasts"
