L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,financing_or_capex,7.7,$M,,,"As of September 19, 2025, being the conversion deadline, we had converted the remaining outstanding aggregate principal amount of US$7.7 million of our 8.50% Convertible Notes at a conversion rate of 127.9743 Class A ordinary shares per US$1,000 principal amount, as adjusted pursuant to the agreement, resulting in the issuance of a total of 985,400 Class A ordinary shares"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,15.0,$M,,,"In July 2025, the holder of the Bitdeer Convertible Note converted its remaining principal amount of US$15.0 million into 2,036,383 Class A ordinary shares at a conversion price of US$7.3660 per share"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,129.6,$M,approximately,,"Pursuant to this transaction, we paid a premium of approximately US$129.6 million for the right to receive, without further payment, approximately 10.2 million Class A ordinary shares, subject to customary adjustments"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,rfs,1,flag,,,"These shares will be delivered by the option counterparty upon expiry of the option, subject to early settlement of the zero-strike call option transaction in whole or in part at the option counterparty’s discretion"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,40.0,$M,,,"On May 30, 2025, our board of directors approved a new share repurchase program to repurchase up to additional US$40.0 million worth of its Class A ordinary shares, effective from May 30, 2025 and ending on May 29, 2026"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,1.0,$M,approximately,,"As of September 29, 2025, we have repurchased 72,200 Class A ordinary shares for approximately US$1.0 million under the foregoing share repurchase program"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,financing_or_capex,200.0,$M,up to,,"In April 2025, we entered into a loan agreement with Matrixport for a financing facility of up to US$200 million (the “April 2025 Matrixport Loan”)"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,contract_value,400.0,$M,,,"In July 2025, we entered into an amendment agreement with Matrixport in relation to the April 2025 Matrixport Loan, pursuant to which Matrixport agreed to extend one or more loans to our Company of up to a total maximum amount of US$400 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,financing_or_capex,400.0,$M,up to,,"In September 2025, we entered into another loan agreement with Matrixport, for a financing facility of up to US$400.0 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,financing_or_capex,85.0,$M,,,"As of September 29, 2025, we had drawn down US$85.0 million under this facility"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"In April 2025, we signed a sale and purchase agreement and a turnkey agreement for the acquisition and construction of a 50 MW mining datacenter in the Oromia region of Ethiopia for US$7.5 million, including a local company with a mining permit, a 33kV substation connection, and a 4-year power purchase agreement with Ethiopian Electric Power Company"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,7.5,$M,,,"In April 2025, we signed a sale and purchase agreement and a turnkey agreement for the acquisition and construction of a 50 MW mining datacenter in the Oromia region of Ethiopia for US$7.5 million, including a local company with a mining permit, a 33kV substation connection, and a 4-year power purchase agreement with Ethiopian Electric Power Company"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,term_years,4.0,years,,,"In April 2025, we signed a sale and purchase agreement and a turnkey agreement for the acquisition and construction of a 50 MW mining datacenter in the Oromia region of Ethiopia for US$7.5 million, including a local company with a mining permit, a 33kV substation connection, and a 4-year power purchase agreement with Ethiopian Electric Power Company"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,101.0,MW,,unspecified,We are collaborating with an EPC contractor with specialized experience in Bitcoin mining and targeting energization by the fourth quarter of 2025.. . 2025 Strategic Acquisition of the 101 MW Site and Gas-fired Power Project in Alberta
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,101.0,MW,,unspecified,"In February 2025, we signed the agreement for the acquisition of a fully licensed and permitted 101 MW site and gas-fired power project situated on 19 acres of land near Fox Creek, Alberta in an all-cash transaction for approximately US$21.7 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,21.7,$M,approximately,,"In February 2025, we signed the agreement for the acquisition of a fully licensed and permitted 101 MW site and gas-fired power project situated on 19 acres of land near Fox Creek, Alberta in an all-cash transaction for approximately US$21.7 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,1000.0,MW,,unspecified,"The site has potential to scale to 1 GW of power, reflecting Alberta’s abundant energy resources, supportive regulatory posture and pro-business environment"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,101.0,MW,,unspecified,"The 101 MW gas-fired power project includes all permits and licenses required to construct an on-site natural gas power plant, as well as approval for a 99 MW grid interconnection with Alberta Electric System Operator"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,mw_gross,99.0,MW,,gross,"The 101 MW gas-fired power project includes all permits and licenses required to construct an on-site natural gas power plant, as well as approval for a 99 MW grid interconnection with Alberta Electric System Operator"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,contract_value,474.5,$M,approximately,,"As of August 31, 2025, we had offered and sold an aggregate of 30,899,686 Class A ordinary shares under the 2024 At Market Issuance Sales Agreement for total net proceeds of approximately US$474.5 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,contract_value,138.2,$M,approximately,,"Of this amount, for the eight months ended August 31, 2025, we offered and sold 7,586,339 Class A ordinary shares for total net proceeds of approximately US$138.2 million"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,218.7,$M,,,"Our revenue increased from US$218.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$225.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, primarily driven by an increase in sales of mining rigs and accessories, offset by a decrease in General Hosting and Membership Hosting.. . ● Revenue generated from our self-mining business increased by 7.2% from US$90.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$96.5 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,225.7,$M,,,"Our revenue increased from US$218.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$225.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, primarily driven by an increase in sales of mining rigs and accessories, offset by a decrease in General Hosting and Membership Hosting.. . ● Revenue generated from our self-mining business increased by 7.2% from US$90.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$96.5 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,90.1,$M,,,"Our revenue increased from US$218.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$225.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, primarily driven by an increase in sales of mining rigs and accessories, offset by a decrease in General Hosting and Membership Hosting.. . ● Revenue generated from our self-mining business increased by 7.2% from US$90.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$96.5 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,96.5,$M,,,"Our revenue increased from US$218.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$225.7 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, primarily driven by an increase in sales of mining rigs and accessories, offset by a decrease in General Hosting and Membership Hosting.. . ● Revenue generated from our self-mining business increased by 7.2% from US$90.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$96.5 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025"
L000121390025093073_ea025619001ex99-2_bitdeer,usd_other,30.3,$M,,,"The hash rate used for self-mining, calculated as the monthly average over the six-month period, was approximately 12.0 EH/s for the six months ended June 30, 2025, compared to 6.8 EH/s for the six months ended June 30, 2024. . . ● Revenue generated from Cloud Hash Rate decreased by 99.8% from US$30.3 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024 to US$0.1 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, which was primarily due to expiration of long-term Cloud Hash Rate contracts and subsequent reallocation of nearly all hash rate of the mining rigs to self-mining operations by the end of 2024"
