L000121390025109562_ea026418601ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,Gross Mining profit Gross Profit adjusted to exclude: (i) non-Mining revenues; (ii) depreciation and amortization; (iii) expenses related to hosting and energy revenues; (iv) purchase of electrical components and other expenses; (v) electrician salaries and payroll taxes; and (vi) sales tax recovery. ● To assess profitability after power costs in cryptocurrency production and other infrastructure costs
