L000121390025109562_ea026418601ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,"Gross Mining margin The percentage obtained when dividing Gross Mining profit by Mining related revenues. ● To assess profitability after power costs in cryptocurrency production, the largest variable expense in Mining.. ● To provide the users of the MD&A the ability to assess the profitability of the Company’s core digital asset Mining operations, exclusive of depreciation and amortization and certain general and administrative expenses"
L000121390025109562_ea026418601ex99-2_bitfarms,power_cost,1,flag,,,"Direct Cost per BTC The amount obtained when dividing Direct Cost by the quantity of BTC earned. ● To assess the Company’s power costs, the largest variable expense in Mining.. ● To provide the users of the MD&A a metric to evaluate the Company’s direct variable cost for its core digital asset Mining operations across time periods.. ● Used by Management to assess the operating performance from period to period and to prepare annual operating budgets and forecasts"
