L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,usd_other,588.0,$M,,,"All financial references are in U.S. dollars.. . “We continue to execute on our strategy to pivot from an international Bitcoin miner to a North American energy and digital infrastructure company,” stated CEO Ben Gagnon. “We recently announced our successful $588 million convertible note offering, alongside our plans to convert our Washington site to HPC/AI workloads where additional monetization strategies for the site, including cloud operations, are being evaluated"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"Beyond Washington, everything in our portfolio is being built to support Nvidia’s next generation Vera Rubin GPUs which are expected to ship in Q4 2026"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"With almost twice the energy density of Nvidia’s Blackwell GPUs, there is not a data center that exists today that can support Nvidia’s next generation of AI hardware.”"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,usd_other,588.0,$M,,,"CFO Jonathan Mir stated, “With the successful completion of our $588 million convertible note offering and the conversion of our $300 million Macquarie debt facility to a project-specific financing for the development of our Panther Creek campus, the company is excited to commence the initial phases of our HPC/AI development, including civil works, substation works, and deposits on long-lead time items, at our Washington, Panther Creek, and Sharon sites"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,financing_or_capex,300.0,$M,,,"CFO Jonathan Mir stated, “With the successful completion of our $588 million convertible note offering and the conversion of our $300 million Macquarie debt facility to a project-specific financing for the development of our Panther Creek campus, the company is excited to commence the initial phases of our HPC/AI development, including civil works, substation works, and deposits on long-lead time items, at our Washington, Panther Creek, and Sharon sites"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,rfs,1,flag,,,"CFO Jonathan Mir stated, “With the successful completion of our $588 million convertible note offering and the conversion of our $300 million Macquarie debt facility to a project-specific financing for the development of our Panther Creek campus, the company is excited to commence the initial phases of our HPC/AI development, including civil works, substation works, and deposits on long-lead time items, at our Washington, Panther Creek, and Sharon sites"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,usd_other,814.0,$M,,,"We now have substantial financial flexibility with $814 million in liquidity** as of November 12, 2025 and an additional $200 million potentially available from the Macquarie facility, and we have a clear vision of how we’re going to best utilize these funds to advance our HPC/AI infrastructure build outs across North America.”. . . 2"
L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,financing_or_capex,200.0,$M,,,"We now have substantial financial flexibility with $814 million in liquidity** as of November 12, 2025 and an additional $200 million potentially available from the Macquarie facility, and we have a clear vision of how we’re going to best utilize these funds to advance our HPC/AI infrastructure build outs across North America.”. . . 2"
