L000121390025109575_ea026548201ex99-1_bitfarms,contract_value,69.0,$M,,,"Q3 2025 Financial Highlights from Continuing Operations . . ● Total revenue of $69 million, up 156% Y/Y . . ● Cash general and administrative expenses (G&A, exclusive of share-based compensation) of $14 million, compared to $20 million in Q3 2024, the improvement was largely driven by lower professional services. . . ● Operating loss of $29 million, including impairment charge of $9 million and non-cash depreciation of $27 million, compared to an operating loss of $31 million in Q3 2024 . . ● Net loss of $46 million, or $0.08 loss per basic and diluted share, compared to a net loss of $24 million, or $0.05 loss per basic and diluted share, in Q3 2024 . . ● Adjusted EBITDA* of $20 million, or 28% of revenue, up from $2 million or 8% of revenue in Q3 2024 . . ● Gross mining margin* of 35%, down from 44% in Q3 2024 . . ● The Company earned 520 BTC at an average Direct Cost per BTC* of $48,200"
