L000121390025121477_ea026963701ex99-1_bitdeer,mw_unspecified,2.0,MW,,unspecified,"Guided by NVIDIA’s reference architecture, Bitdeer continues to build a comprehensive suite of capabilities spanning from infrastructure (IaaS) through cloud software platforms (PaaS), while also remaining open to colocation opportunities. . . ○ Secured a 2 MW AI data center lease in Malaysia to host 8 GB200 systems, with the facility expected to be ready for launch by year-end 2025 or shortly thereafter"
