L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,usd_other,2400.0,$M,,,"He served as the Chief Operating Officer at Paxos for over 7 years, where he played a pivotal role in growing the company from a small startup to a $2.4 billion valuation"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,Google,,,,"Chang held operational and growth positions at Google, Techstars, WPP and several innovative startups"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,Amazon,,,,"Principal Occupations (2) ● Independent Director of the Corporation (2025 – present). ● Vice President, Engineering and Technology, 1Password (2025 – present). ● Vice President, Storage, Edge Compute, and Data Services, Amazon Web Services (2012 – 2024)"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,Amazon,,,,"At AWS, he launched and scaled multiple data and storage services into multibillion-dollar businesses, while building AWS Boston into one of Amazon’s largest development centers"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,tenant,AWS,,,,"At AWS, he launched and scaled multiple data and storage services into multibillion-dollar businesses, while building AWS Boston into one of Amazon’s largest development centers"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,usd_other,3000.0,$M,,,"At EMC, he defined strategy for a $3B ARR product line and introduced EMC’s first software-defined storage array"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,credit_support,1,flag,,,"Bitfarms Canada’s pivot to HPC/AI is driven by a surging global demand for compute infrastructure, capacity constraints in traditional data center markets, and the potential for multiple expansions through long-term contracted revenue streams with investment-grade counterparties"
L000121390026020066_ea02779011ex99-1_bitfarms,credit_support,1,flag,,,"Bitfarms Canada intends to develop and lease infrastructure supporting GPU clusters and specialized AI hardware to investment-grade hyperscalers, cloud service providers, AI companies, and enterprises needing high-density compute capacity"
