L000121390026053566_ea028958501ex99-1,mw_unspecified,40.0,MW,,unspecified,"Digi Power X Signs AI Colocation Agreement with Leading AI Compute Company for 40 MW Data Center in Columbiana, Alabama"
L000121390026053566_ea028958501ex99-1,mw_unspecified,40.0,MW,,unspecified,"(Nasdaq: DGXX / Cboe Canada: DGX) (the “Company” or “Digi Power X”), an AI data center infrastructure operator, today announced the execution of a Master Services Agreement (the “Agreement”) with Cerebras Systems (the “Customer”) for the colocation of a purpose-built, 40 megawatt (“MW”) AI data center campus located in Columbiana, Alabama (the “Facility”)"
L000121390026053566_ea028958501ex99-1,contract_value,1100.0,$M,approximately,,"The initial 10-year term is valued at approximately $1.1 billion, with total potential contract value of up to $2.5 billion inclusive of renewal terms – underpinned by a structure that provides Digi Power X with long-term revenue visibility, and Cerebras with guaranteed data center capacity, from the first day of service"
