L000121390026053566_ea028958501ex99-1,usd_other,1100.0,$M,,,"Signing a $1.1 billion anchor contract with a premier AI compute company is validation of everything we have built – our team, our sites, our infrastructure capabilities, and our vision for what a next-generation data center operator looks like"
