L000121390026058746_ea029138201ex99-1,mw_unspecified,25.0,MW,,unspecified,"BlockchAIn | NYSE: AIB NYSE: AI C O M P A N Y O V E R V I E W Path to Success: 3 keys Drive Every Decision at BlockchAIn 0 1 — P O W E R Power We secure executed utility agreements before breaking ground — targeting markets with available generation and transmission capacity, the critical bottleneck limiting AI growth. 0 2 — P I P E L I N E Pipeline 25 MW of signed non-binding LOIs, which could translate into $500M+ in potential long-term contract value — demand is outpacing capacity. 0 3 — P E O P L E People Our team has delivered 3GW+ of data center construction and closed $256M+ in hyperscale deals — with deep expertise across power, capital markets, and real estate to execute at scale"
