L000121390026063565_ea029232801ex99-1,mw_unspecified,65.0,MW,,unspecified,"BlockchAIn Executes 15-Year, 65 MW Electric Service Agreement at CLT-01 to Meet Demand for AI Data Center Capacity"
L000121390026063565_ea029232801ex99-1,term_years,15.0,years,,,"BlockchAIn Executes 15-Year, 65 MW Electric Service Agreement at CLT-01 to Meet Demand for AI Data Center Capacity"
L000121390026063565_ea029232801ex99-1,mw_gross,40.0,MW,,gross,Expands Contracted Utility Load at CLT-01 from 40 MW to 65 MW Under a 15-Year Term
L000121390026063565_ea029232801ex99-1,mw_gross,65.0,MW,,gross,Expands Contracted Utility Load at CLT-01 from 40 MW to 65 MW Under a 15-Year Term
