L000121390026067329_ea029430601ex99-1,contract_value,160.0,$M,,,NEW CLOUD SERVICES CONTRACT WINS Contracted growth across owned GPU capacity and project-level financing PARIS REGION Paris Region Deployment Investment-grade technology customer >$160M Total Contract Value 5 Yrs Contract Term Jul '26 Service Commences • Advanced NVIDIA GPU systems deployed in France • Supported by customer prepayments and project-level financing • Limited long-term reliance on WhiteFiber's corporate balance sheet U.S. — OWNED FLEET Hyperbolic / Modal Labs Modal Labs as end customer & reference partner ~$17M Total Contract Value 2 Yrs Contract Term Jun '26 Revenue Begins • Deploys H200 GPUs from WhiteFiber's existing owned fleet • No incremental GPU capital expenditures required • Modal Labs supports ongoing R&D via input on design and development Note: Cloud contract wins announced May 2026
