L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,1300.0,$M,approximately,,"Morgan and another top-tier global financial institution via Letters of Credit, totaling approximately $1.3 billion and subject to customary conditions. . . ● Tydal, Norway AI Data Center expected to be among Norway’s largest and most efficient AI data centers upon completion"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,term_years,16.0,years,,,"SINGAPORE, August 4, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) – Bitdeer AI, part of Bitdeer Technologies Group (NASDAQ: BTDR), (“Bitdeer” or the “Company”), an emerging AI cloud service, AI infrastructure provider and NVIDIA Cloud Partner, announced today that it has executed a 16-year colocation lease and services agreement through its subsidiary, Tydal Data Center AS (“TDC”) with Volta Tydal AS, a subsidiary of Volta, an NVIDIA Cloud Partner"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"SINGAPORE, August 4, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) – Bitdeer AI, part of Bitdeer Technologies Group (NASDAQ: BTDR), (“Bitdeer” or the “Company”), an emerging AI cloud service, AI infrastructure provider and NVIDIA Cloud Partner, announced today that it has executed a 16-year colocation lease and services agreement through its subsidiary, Tydal Data Center AS (“TDC”) with Volta Tydal AS, a subsidiary of Volta, an NVIDIA Cloud Partner"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,4700.0,$M,approximately,,The agreement represents approximately $4.7 billion in contracted revenue over the initial 16-year base term
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,term_years,16.0,years,,,The agreement represents approximately $4.7 billion in contracted revenue over the initial 16-year base term
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,8000.0,$M,approximately,,An 8-year renewal option increases the potential total contract value to approximately $8.0 billion over 24 years
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,term_years,8.0,years,,,An 8-year renewal option increases the potential total contract value to approximately $8.0 billion over 24 years
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,power_cost,1,flag,,,"The lease is structured as a modified gross arrangement with an average payment of approximately $202/kW/month over the first 16 years, with electricity costs reimbursed by the tenant on a pass-through basis"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,credit_support,1,flag,,,Volta’s obligations are anticipated to be supported by a credit backstop in the form of Letters of Credit arranged by affiliates of J.P
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,1300.0,$M,approximately,,"Morgan and another top-tier global financial institution, totaling approximately $1.3 billion and subject to customary conditions"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"Bitdeer is delighted to be partnering with Volta, Dell Technologies, NVIDIA, J.P"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"This project will incorporate leading-edge NVIDIA GPU technology and frontier models from a leading AI lab into a data center that is powered exclusively through highly reliable, carbon-free energy sources"
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,4700.0,$M,Approximately,,Contract Economics . . ● Total contract value: Approximately $4.7 billion over the initial 16-year base term; Tenant has a no fee termination right at 10 years . . ● Tenant’s Renewal option: 8-year extension increases potential total contract value to approximately $8.0 billion over 24 years . . ● Modified gross lease: 16-year average rate of approximately $202/kW/month total; electricity costs fully reimbursed by tenant . . ● Revenue per IT MW: Expected average annual revenue of $2.4 million per IT MW over 16 years . . ● NOI Margin: Estimated NOI Margin of approximately 90% . . ● Escalators: 3% annual increases on both lease and services agreement
L000121390026085655_ea030075201ex99-1,contract_value,8000.0,$M,approximately,,Contract Economics . . ● Total contract value: Approximately $4.7 billion over the initial 16-year base term; Tenant has a no fee termination right at 10 years . . ● Tenant’s Renewal option: 8-year extension increases potential total contract value to approximately $8.0 billion over 24 years . . ● Modified gross lease: 16-year average rate of approximately $202/kW/month total; electricity costs fully reimbursed by tenant . . ● Revenue per IT MW: Expected average annual revenue of $2.4 million per IT MW over 16 years . . ● NOI Margin: Estimated NOI Margin of approximately 90% . . ● Escalators: 3% annual increases on both lease and services agreement
