L000130696524000028_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,usd_other,10000.0,$M,,,"In 2023, access to the international debt capital markets remained strong, with our debt principally financed from these markets through central debt programmes consisting of: ￮ a $10 billion global commercial paper (CP) programme, with maturities between 183 days and 364 days; ￮ a $10 billion US CP programme, with maturities not exceeding 397 days; ￮ an unlimited Euro medium-term note (EMTN) programme (also referred to as the Multi-Currency Debt Securities Programme); and ￮ an unlimited US universal shelf (US shelf) registration"
L000130696524000028_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,usd_other,10000.0,$M,,,"In 2023, access to the international debt capital markets remained strong, with our debt principally financed from these markets through central debt programmes consisting of: ￮ a $10 billion global commercial paper (CP) programme, with maturities between 183 days and 364 days; ￮ a $10 billion US CP programme, with maturities not exceeding 397 days; ￮ an unlimited Euro medium-term note (EMTN) programme (also referred to as the Multi-Currency Debt Securities Programme); and ￮ an unlimited US universal shelf (US shelf) registration"
