L000130696524000028_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,usd_other,54200.0,$M,,,"Finalising the 2023 pay outcomes In finalising pay outcomes, the REMCO considered Shell's wider performance and context during 2023 and over the LTIP performance period, paying particular attention to: ￮ The strong financial performance in 2023, with CFFO of $54.2 billion and free cash flow* (FCF) of $36.5 billion, which has enabled Shell to invest in our businesses, reduce debt and enhance shareholder distributions"
