L000130696524000028_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,rfs,1,flag,,,The Executive Directors' remuneration structure is made up of a fixed element of basic pay and two variable elements: the annual bonus (50% delivered in shares) and the Long-term Incentive Plan (LTIP)
