L000130696525000011_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,rfs,1,flag,,,"Moving forward In 2024, we delivered our strategy against the four themes of generating shareholder value, achieving net-zero emissions, respecting nature and powering lives"
L000130696525000011_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,contract_value,23000.0,$M,,,"We seek to provide enhanced shareholder distributions through our progressive dividend policy and share buyback programmes. 2024 performance ￮ Total shareholder distributions* were $23 billion, comprising $9 billion in cash dividends and $14 billion in share buybacks. ￮ Total shareholder distributions* were 41% of cash flow from operating activities. ￮ Cash flow from operating activities was $55 billion. ￮ Cash capital expenditure* was $21 billion. ￮ Total debt was reduced to $77 billion and net debt* was $39 billion as of December 31, 2024"
