L000130696525000011_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,rfs,1,flag,,,"Energy products consist of energy oil products (gasoline, diesel, kerosene, fuel oil and LPG), GTL, biofuels, liquefied natural gas, pipeline gas and power. [E] In 2024, consistent with revisions of NCI values, we revised the estimated total energy delivered by Shell from 16.07 trillion (10^12) MJ (t MJ) to 16.13t MJ for 2023, from 16.29t MJ to 16.34t MJ for 2022 and from 20.93t MJ to 20.80t MJ for 2016"
