L000130696525000011_a6-kannualreportandaccounts,rfs,1,flag,,,"Share of estimated total energy delivered per energy product type [A, B, C] [A] Percentage of delivered energy may not add up to 100% because of rounding. [B] Total volume of energy products sold, aggregated on an energy basis (lower heating value) with power represented as fossil equivalents. [C] In 2024, consistent with revisions of NCI values, the share of energy delivered through sales of biofuels was revised from 1% to 2% in 2023 and 2022"
