L000134287425000014_a2024terniumannualreport,financing_or_capex,148.4,$M,,,"During 2017 and 2016, Techgen’s shareholders made additional investments in Techgen, in the form of subordinated loans, which in the case of Ternium amounted to $ 148.4 million as of December 31, 2024, and which are due in June 2026. . 103"
L000134287425000014_a2024terniumannualreport,credit_support,1,flag,,,"On February 2019, Techgen S.A. de C.V. entered into syndicated loan agreement with HSBC Mexico, Natixis, Credit Agricole, BNP, Santander, Intesa SP and Norinchukin (the “Syndicated Loan”), according to the following terms: (i) Libor + 170 bps; (ii) maturity on February 13, 2026; (iii) average life 4,30 years; and (iv) guaranteed by: assets, shares, a debt service reserve account - which represents 10% of the outstanding amount- and the fix capacity charge cash-flow"
L000134287425000014_a2024terniumannualreport,financing_or_capex,68.0,$M,,,"On August 5, 2021, Ternium Investments completed the purchase of a participation in this Syndicated Loan for an amount of $ 68 million"
