L000134287426000015_a2025terniumannualreport,rfs,1,flag,,,The Company recognizes a right-of-use asset and a lease liability at the commencement date of each lease contract that grants the right to control the use of an identified asset during a period of time
L000134287426000015_a2025terniumannualreport,rfs,1,flag,,,The commencement date is the date in which the lessor makes an underlying asset available for use by the lessee
L000134287426000015_a2025terniumannualreport,rfs,1,flag,,,"- Any lease payments made at or before the commencement date, less any lease incentives; and"
L000134287426000015_a2025terniumannualreport,rfs,1,flag,,,"If the lease transfers ownership of the underlying asset to the Company by the end of the lease term, or if the cost of the right-of-use asset reflects that the Company will exercise a purchase option, the Company depreciates the right-of-use asset from the commencement date to the end of the useful life of the underlying asset"
L000134287426000015_a2025terniumannualreport,rfs,1,flag,,,"Otherwise, the Company depreciates the right-of-use asset from the commencement date to the earlier of the end of the useful life of the right-of-use asset or the end of the lease term"
