L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,18.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI Issues Fiscal Year 2026 Guidance: $300 Million in Forward ARR, Backed by 18 MW of Capacity"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,usd_other,300.0,$M,,,"QumulusAI Issues Fiscal Year 2026 Guidance: $300 Million in Forward ARR, Backed by 18 MW of Capacity"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI expects approximately 30x ARR growth in fiscal 2026 over fiscal 2025, with line of sight to 2.5 gigawatts in 2027"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,18.0,MW,,unspecified,"For fiscal year 2026, the company expects forward ARR of $300 million, approximately 30x growth in fiscal 2026 over fiscal 2025, backed by 18 megawatts (MW) of year-end fiscal 2026 data center capacity with a line of sight to 2.5 gigawatts (GW) by year-end fiscal 2027"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"For fiscal year 2026, the company expects forward ARR of $300 million, approximately 30x growth in fiscal 2026 over fiscal 2025, backed by 18 megawatts (MW) of year-end fiscal 2026 data center capacity with a line of sight to 2.5 gigawatts (GW) by year-end fiscal 2027"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,usd_other,300.0,$M,,,"For fiscal year 2026, the company expects forward ARR of $300 million, approximately 30x growth in fiscal 2026 over fiscal 2025, backed by 18 megawatts (MW) of year-end fiscal 2026 data center capacity with a line of sight to 2.5 gigawatts (GW) by year-end fiscal 2027"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,usd_other,300.0,$M,,,"Forward ARR of $300 million is expected as of December 31, 2026, and comprises executed contract revenue to date, expected renewals, deposit-backed compute capacity reservations and projected contract signings, in each case reflecting ARR expected upon activation of the associated compute capacity"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,18.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI expects 18 MW of data center capacity as of December 31, 2026, comprising 8 MW of active high-performance computing (HPC) power and 10 MW of HPC power in development, under executed lease or colocation agreements that are operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,8.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI expects 18 MW of data center capacity as of December 31, 2026, comprising 8 MW of active high-performance computing (HPC) power and 10 MW of HPC power in development, under executed lease or colocation agreements that are operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,10.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI expects 18 MW of data center capacity as of December 31, 2026, comprising 8 MW of active high-performance computing (HPC) power and 10 MW of HPC power in development, under executed lease or colocation agreements that are operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,fitout,1,flag,,,"QumulusAI expects 18 MW of data center capacity as of December 31, 2026, comprising 8 MW of active high-performance computing (HPC) power and 10 MW of HPC power in development, under executed lease or colocation agreements that are operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,Growth beyond 2026 is supported by line of sight to 2.5 GW of capacity by the end of fiscal year 2027
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,50.0,MW,,unspecified,"QumulusAI houses the latest NVIDIA GPUs, including Blackwell (B300/B200), Hopper (H100/H200) and RTX PRO 6000, in colocation facilities and data centers of less than 50 MW capacity, on a quarterly deployment cadence designed to accelerate time to value for customers.. . “We designed this guidance framework to be simple to track,” said Scott Krosnowski, CFO of QumulusAI. “Forward ARR and capacity capture both sides of our model: the demand we activate and the infrastructure we deliver it on"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"QumulusAI houses the latest NVIDIA GPUs, including Blackwell (B300/B200), Hopper (H100/H200) and RTX PRO 6000, in colocation facilities and data centers of less than 50 MW capacity, on a quarterly deployment cadence designed to accelerate time to value for customers.. . “We designed this guidance framework to be simple to track,” said Scott Krosnowski, CFO of QumulusAI. “Forward ARR and capacity capture both sides of our model: the demand we activate and the infrastructure we deliver it on"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,annual_revenue,300.0,$M,,,Forward Annualized Recurring Revenue (ARR)¹. $300M (~30x growth in fiscal 2026 over fiscal 2025)
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,18.0,MW,,unspecified,"Capacity². 18 MW (line of sight to 2.5 GW by year-end fiscal 2027). . . ¹ Forward ARR expected as of December 31, 2026, comprising executed contract revenue to date, expected renewals, deposit-backed compute capacity reservations, and projected contract signings, in each case reflecting ARR expected upon activation of the associated compute capacity. ² Data center capacity under executed lease or colocation agreements, operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment, in each case available for, or expected to become available for, compute deployments as of December 31, 2026"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,,unspecified,"Capacity². 18 MW (line of sight to 2.5 GW by year-end fiscal 2027). . . ¹ Forward ARR expected as of December 31, 2026, comprising executed contract revenue to date, expected renewals, deposit-backed compute capacity reservations, and projected contract signings, in each case reflecting ARR expected upon activation of the associated compute capacity. ² Data center capacity under executed lease or colocation agreements, operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment, in each case available for, or expected to become available for, compute deployments as of December 31, 2026"
L000143774926023568_ex_988109,fitout,1,flag,,,"Capacity². 18 MW (line of sight to 2.5 GW by year-end fiscal 2027). . . ¹ Forward ARR expected as of December 31, 2026, comprising executed contract revenue to date, expected renewals, deposit-backed compute capacity reservations, and projected contract signings, in each case reflecting ARR expected upon activation of the associated compute capacity. ² Data center capacity under executed lease or colocation agreements, operational or undergoing build-out, power activation, or customer deployment, in each case available for, or expected to become available for, compute deployments as of December 31, 2026"
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,usd_other,6.7,$M,,,Revenue more than doubles year over year to $6.7 million as contracted GPU capacity continues to come online; cumulative signed customer contract value reaches $282.5 million
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,contract_value,282.5,$M,,,Revenue more than doubles year over year to $6.7 million as contracted GPU capacity continues to come online; cumulative signed customer contract value reaches $282.5 million
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,mw_unspecified,3.75,MW,up to,unspecified,"We signed 21 new direct contracts in the quarter, and last week we contracted up to 3.75 MW in metropolitan Atlanta, our home market, with potential to expand at the same site"
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,annual_revenue,18.0,$M,,,"Deploying against it faster than competitors is our goal."". . ""Revenue more than doubled year over year and gross margin expanded to 67%, as GPU activations grew revenue faster than colocation costs,"" said Scott Krosnowski, CFO of QumulusAI. ""Our most recent Blackwell contracts are generating between $18 million and $20 million of annualized revenue per megawatt, compared with just over $16 million across the installed base"
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,annual_revenue,20.0,$M,,,"Deploying against it faster than competitors is our goal."". . ""Revenue more than doubled year over year and gross margin expanded to 67%, as GPU activations grew revenue faster than colocation costs,"" said Scott Krosnowski, CFO of QumulusAI. ""Our most recent Blackwell contracts are generating between $18 million and $20 million of annualized revenue per megawatt, compared with just over $16 million across the installed base"
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,annual_revenue,16.0,$M,over,,"Deploying against it faster than competitors is our goal."". . ""Revenue more than doubled year over year and gross margin expanded to 67%, as GPU activations grew revenue faster than colocation costs,"" said Scott Krosnowski, CFO of QumulusAI. ""Our most recent Blackwell contracts are generating between $18 million and $20 million of annualized revenue per megawatt, compared with just over $16 million across the installed base"
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,usd_other,30.5,$M,,,"Customers are also committing and paying ahead of delivery — deferred revenue rose $30.5 million in the first half, contributing to $22.3 million of operating cash flow."""
L000143774926028918_ex_1008743,usd_other,22.3,$M,,,"Customers are also committing and paying ahead of delivery — deferred revenue rose $30.5 million in the first half, contributing to $22.3 million of operating cash flow."""
