L000149315225012458_ex99-1,mw_it,400.0,MW,,it,"Polaris Forge 1 Campus to Now Deliver 400MW in Total Critical IT Capacity to CoreWeave, Further Bolstering Applied Digital’s Strategic Expansion into Advanced Compute Infrastructure"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Polaris Forge 1 Campus to Now Deliver 400MW in Total Critical IT Capacity to CoreWeave, Further Bolstering Applied Digital’s Strategic Expansion into Advanced Compute Infrastructure"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,150.0,MW,,unspecified,"DALLAS — Aug. 29, 2025 — Applied Digital (NASDAQ: APLD) announced today that it has finalized a new lease agreement with CoreWeave, the AI Hyperscaler™, for an additional 150MW at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus in Ellendale, North Dakota"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"DALLAS — Aug. 29, 2025 — Applied Digital (NASDAQ: APLD) announced today that it has finalized a new lease agreement with CoreWeave, the AI Hyperscaler™, for an additional 150MW at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus in Ellendale, North Dakota"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,tenant,Hyperscaler,,,,"DALLAS — Aug. 29, 2025 — Applied Digital (NASDAQ: APLD) announced today that it has finalized a new lease agreement with CoreWeave, the AI Hyperscaler™, for an additional 150MW at its Polaris Forge 1 Campus in Ellendale, North Dakota"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,contract_value,11000.0,$M,approximately,,"This new lease agreement with CoreWeave brings Applied Digital’s total anticipated contracted lease revenue to approximately $11B, which includes $7B in revenue from the initial two approximately 15-year leases executed in May of this year"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,contract_value,7000.0,$M,,,"This new lease agreement with CoreWeave brings Applied Digital’s total anticipated contracted lease revenue to approximately $11B, which includes $7B in revenue from the initial two approximately 15-year leases executed in May of this year"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,term_years,15.0,years,,,"This new lease agreement with CoreWeave brings Applied Digital’s total anticipated contracted lease revenue to approximately $11B, which includes $7B in revenue from the initial two approximately 15-year leases executed in May of this year"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"This new lease agreement with CoreWeave brings Applied Digital’s total anticipated contracted lease revenue to approximately $11B, which includes $7B in revenue from the initial two approximately 15-year leases executed in May of this year"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,mw_it,400.0,MW,,it,"With this new long-term lease agreement, the total critical IT capacity across these three long-term lease agreements will encompass 400MW across Applied Digital’s sprawling, purpose-built Polaris Forge 1 Campus strategically designed to power CoreWeave’s artificial intelligence (AI) and high-performance computing (HPC) initiatives. . . “This new lease agreement with CoreWeave underpins our commitment to building the next generation of AI infrastructure right here in America’s heartland,” said Wes Cummins, Chairman and CEO of Applied Digital. “It also further reinforces the importance of North Dakota’s role in shaping the future of the digital economy and is another step in advancing its position as one of the most strategic destinations for AI in the world.”"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"With this new long-term lease agreement, the total critical IT capacity across these three long-term lease agreements will encompass 400MW across Applied Digital’s sprawling, purpose-built Polaris Forge 1 Campus strategically designed to power CoreWeave’s artificial intelligence (AI) and high-performance computing (HPC) initiatives. . . “This new lease agreement with CoreWeave underpins our commitment to building the next generation of AI infrastructure right here in America’s heartland,” said Wes Cummins, Chairman and CEO of Applied Digital. “It also further reinforces the importance of North Dakota’s role in shaping the future of the digital economy and is another step in advancing its position as one of the most strategic destinations for AI in the world.”"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,150.0,MW,,unspecified,"The additional 150MW data center will be housed in the third building of Polaris Forge 1, which is currently in the planning stages"
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,The new lease agreement is anticipated to be at full capacity and ready for service in mid 2027
L000149315225012458_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Under the initial May lease agreements, the first 100MW data center for CoreWeave is scheduled to be ready for service in Q4 of 2025 and the second building, which is expected to house a 150MW data center, is currently under construction and is expected to be operational in the middle of 2026"
