L000149315226005788_form8-k,rfs,1,flag,,,"Since the Company’s pivot in its business strategy and becoming one of the leading designers, builders, and operators of high-performance, sustainably engineered data centers and colocation services for artificial intelligence, cloud, networking, and blockchain workloads, the Company has delivered strong stockholder returns"
L000149315226005788_form8-k,mw_unspecified,400.0,MW,,unspecified,"The Company reached a significant milestone in 2025, by leasing the full capacity of its first 400MW high performance computing (“HPC”) data center campus in Ellendale, North Dakota (“Polaris Forge 1”) to a hyperscaler tenant, as well as signing a lease for 200MW of its Harwood, North Dakota campus (“Polaris Forge 2”), which is in early construction phases, with an investment-grade hyperscaler tenant"
