L000149315226006487_ex99-1,usd_other,41.8,$M,,,"On March 20, 2024, the Company entered into a definitive agreement with SFF to acquire all of the issued and outstanding common shares of SFF through a plan of arrangement for an aggregate consideration of up to 5,859,561 common shares of PowerBank (“PowerBank Shares”) for an aggregate purchase price of $41.8 million"
