L000149315226013456_ex99-1,usd_other,8.4,$M,,,"Fourth Quarter 2025 Financial Results . . ● Revenue in Q4 2025 grew sequentially from Q3 – it grew by 9% from $8.4 million to $9.2 million on volume growth from operational expansion, offset by headwinds on lower hashprice. . . . . ● Q4 2025 gross profit decreased sequentially from $2.3 million to $1.8 million – driven by a softening of hashprice due to the challenging Bitcoin environment offset, in part, by an increase in volume from completing Dorothy 2. . . ● Stronger liquidity position in Q4 2025 – Total cash grew $28.4 million (47%) from $60.5 million in Q3 to $88.8 million in Q4 from equity raises, further bolstering our reserves for future investment opportunities"
