L000149315226037586_form8-k,mw_it,43.0,MW,,it,"HCWC is filing this Current Report on Form 8-K (this “ Current Report ”) to disclose that on August 7, 2026, Host Digital entered into a 15-year lease with one of the world’s largest privately-held cloud infrastructure companies, pursuant to which Host Digital will provide 43 MW of critical IT load capacity at its existing data center facility in northeast Oklahoma (the “ Lease ”)"
L000149315226037586_form8-k,term_years,15.0,years,,,"HCWC is filing this Current Report on Form 8-K (this “ Current Report ”) to disclose that on August 7, 2026, Host Digital entered into a 15-year lease with one of the world’s largest privately-held cloud infrastructure companies, pursuant to which Host Digital will provide 43 MW of critical IT load capacity at its existing data center facility in northeast Oklahoma (the “ Lease ”)"
L000149315226037586_form8-k,annual_revenue,1250.0,$M,approximately,,"The Lease is structured on a take-or-pay basis with renewal options and annual rent escalators and represents approximately $1.25 billion in base-term contracted revenue, or approximately $3.2 billion if all renewal options are exercised over a 30-year total term, with delivery expected in the first quarter of 2027"
