L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,583.0,MW,Over,unspecified,Completes Vertical Integration at Project Dorothy 1; Pipeline expands to 6.3 GW; Over 583 MW of AI projects added to development pipeline
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,rfs,1,flag,,,"(“Soluna” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: SLNH), a developer of green data centers for intensive computing applications, including Bitcoin mining and AI, announced its financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026. . . “This is Soluna’s fifth consecutive quarter of sequential revenue growth, and a 145% year-over-year increase that reflects the operating leverage we are building across the portfolio,” said John Belizaire, CEO of Soluna Holdings. “Kati 1 delivered its first positive gross profit, and Dorothy 1A had its strongest quarter to date"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,fitout,1,flag,,,That operating base is the foundation for the much larger AI build-out now taking shape across our pipeline
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,6300.0,MW,approximately,unspecified,"And with Ryan Carver joining as Chief Development Officer, we’ve added hyperscale AI delivery experience to lead that build.” . . “This quarter, we expanded our development pipeline to approximately 6.3 gigawatts, with major capacity growth across our AI sites,” Belizaire continued. “The Dorothy 3 campus grew to 300 megawatts, and our joint venture with Metrobloks gives Kati 2 a defined path from an initial 100 megawatts of critical IT capacity toward 350 megawatts"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"And with Ryan Carver joining as Chief Development Officer, we’ve added hyperscale AI delivery experience to lead that build.” . . “This quarter, we expanded our development pipeline to approximately 6.3 gigawatts, with major capacity growth across our AI sites,” Belizaire continued. “The Dorothy 3 campus grew to 300 megawatts, and our joint venture with Metrobloks gives Kati 2 a defined path from an initial 100 megawatts of critical IT capacity toward 350 megawatts"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_it,100.0,MW,,it,"And with Ryan Carver joining as Chief Development Officer, we’ve added hyperscale AI delivery experience to lead that build.” . . “This quarter, we expanded our development pipeline to approximately 6.3 gigawatts, with major capacity growth across our AI sites,” Belizaire continued. “The Dorothy 3 campus grew to 300 megawatts, and our joint venture with Metrobloks gives Kati 2 a defined path from an initial 100 megawatts of critical IT capacity toward 350 megawatts"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_it,350.0,MW,,it,"And with Ryan Carver joining as Chief Development Officer, we’ve added hyperscale AI delivery experience to lead that build.” . . “This quarter, we expanded our development pipeline to approximately 6.3 gigawatts, with major capacity growth across our AI sites,” Belizaire continued. “The Dorothy 3 campus grew to 300 megawatts, and our joint venture with Metrobloks gives Kati 2 a defined path from an initial 100 megawatts of critical IT capacity toward 350 megawatts"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,583.0,MW,,unspecified,"We also dedicated three additional development sites to AI capacity, with Projects Hedy, Ellen, and Fei advancing through power term sheets to a combined 583 megawatts of behind-the-meter power aimed at AI and HPC workloads"
L000149315226037734_ex99-1,mw_unspecified,150.0,MW,,unspecified,"Recent Operational and Corporate Highlights: . . ● Completed Vertical Integration at Project Dorothy - Consolidated ownership of Project Dorothy 1: . . ◌ Acquired 150 MW Briscoe Wind Farm on April 1 for a $53.0 million base price. . . ◌ Acquired Spring Lane Capital’s 85.4% Class B interest in Dorothy 1A on April 15 for $16.5 million. . . ◌ Acquired Navitas’ 49% interest in Dorothy 1B on May 19 for approximately $8.8 million. . . ◌ Soluna now owns both the generation and the compute across all 50 MW of Project Dorothy 1. . . ● Signed Kati 2 AI Joint Venture with Metrobloks - On June 3, 2026, Soluna entered into a joint venture agreement with Metrobloks to develop Project Kati 2"
