L000155837025001389_riot-20250224xex99d2,power_cost,1,flag,,,"See Appendix on slides 31-35 for definitions, terms, and reconciliations. ▪ Total Self-Mining costs net of power credits for Q4 2024 of $63.7MM compared to Q3 2024 costs of $39.0MM 1,2 ▪ Global network hash rate up 16% in Q4 2024 vs Q3 2024 5 - Global network hash rate averaged 728 EH/s in Q4 2024 versus 625 EH/s in Q3 2024 ▪ ‘Direct Costs, Non-Power’ includes direct labor, miner insurance, miner and miner-related equipment repair, land lease and related property taxes, network costs and other utilities expenses ▪ ‘Direct Costs, Non-Power’ per BTC is flat quarter-over-quarter from $8,703 per BTC to $8,730 per BTC ▪ Non-power costs declined from 25% of total costs in Q3 2024 to 21% of total costs in Q4 2024 1 2 3 4 ‘Direct Costs, Power’ per BTC ‘Direct Costs, Non-Power’ per BTC 10 5"
