L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,mw_it,500.0,MW,approximately,it,"Core Scientific Oct HPC Option 3 Release - 2 . . . . “In May, we communicated our plans to contract approximately 500 megawatts of critical IT load to host high-performance computing"
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,rfs,1,flag,,,"With today’s announcement, we have delivered on that commitment,” said Adam Sullivan, Core Scientific’s Chief Executive Officer. “There is significant demand for infrastructure to support next generation compute workloads"
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,Our contracts with CoreWeave represent the foundation for Core Scientific’s evolution into a leading data center business ideally positioned to meet that demand.” . . . “We are now working to expand power allocations at some of our existing data centers to increase our capacity for HPC hosting while also continuing to evaluate new sites in our pipeline to expand our business opportunity
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Consistent with the terms of the agreements with CoreWeave previously announced on June 3 rd , all capital investments required to modify Core Scientific’s existing infrastructure into cutting-edge, application-specific data centers customized for power-dense HPC will be funded by CoreWeave"
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,fitout,1,flag,,,"Consistent with the terms of the agreements with CoreWeave previously announced on June 3 rd , all capital investments required to modify Core Scientific’s existing infrastructure into cutting-edge, application-specific data centers customized for power-dense HPC will be funded by CoreWeave"
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,usd_other,180.0,$M,,,An estimated $180 million of the capital investments associated with Core Scientific-owned infrastructure supporting today’s announced option exercise will be credited against hosting payments as capex credits at no more than 50% of monthly fees until fully repaid
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,The latest contract option with CoreWeave also provides opportunities for two renewal terms of five years each
L000162828024043341_corescientifichpcoption3re,mw_unspecified,382.0,MW,,unspecified,"Building on the previously announced 382 MW of infrastructure for HPC hosting, the option exercise announced today will position Core Scientific to provide a total of approximately 500 MW of critical IT load for HPC infrastructure to CoreWeave by the second half of 2026"
