L000162828024045714_q32024corescientificinc-ea,mw_it,11.0,MW,,it,"We expanded our infrastructure further by securing a new data center in Alabama with 11 megawatts of critical IT load and the potential for expansion to 66 megawatts, and we progressed in transitioning two existing data center sites from bitcoin mining to HPC hosting.” . . . “We view our updated 800 megawatts of gross infrastructure available for HPC hosting as the foundation for our data center business, which we will continue to to expand by securing additional power at some of our existing sites and by acquiring new powered sites that we can contract to new clients"
L000162828024045714_q32024corescientificinc-ea,mw_it,66.0,MW,,it,"We expanded our infrastructure further by securing a new data center in Alabama with 11 megawatts of critical IT load and the potential for expansion to 66 megawatts, and we progressed in transitioning two existing data center sites from bitcoin mining to HPC hosting.” . . . “We view our updated 800 megawatts of gross infrastructure available for HPC hosting as the foundation for our data center business, which we will continue to to expand by securing additional power at some of our existing sites and by acquiring new powered sites that we can contract to new clients"
