L000162828025008130_corzearningspresentation,usd_other,1.5,$M,Up to,,Up to $1.5 million per HPC MW (or approximately $750 million) of data center build out costs are funded by CoreWeave and credited against hosting payments at no more than 50% of monthly fees until fully repaid
