L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,265.5,$M,,,"Fourth quarter net loss of $265.5 million resulted primarily from a net $224.7 million non-cash mark-to-market adjustment in the value of our tranche 1 and tranche 2 warrants and other contingent value rights required as a result of the significant quarter-over-quarter increase in our share price. . . . ""In the fourth quarter, Core Scientific continued to build on what was a transformational year for our business,"" said Adam Sullivan, Core Scientific’s Chief Executive Officer. ""We successfully executed our growth strategy across multiple fronts, achieving significant milestones in both our HPC and Bitcoin mining operations"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,224.7,$M,,,"Fourth quarter net loss of $265.5 million resulted primarily from a net $224.7 million non-cash mark-to-market adjustment in the value of our tranche 1 and tranche 2 warrants and other contingent value rights required as a result of the significant quarter-over-quarter increase in our share price. . . . ""In the fourth quarter, Core Scientific continued to build on what was a transformational year for our business,"" said Adam Sullivan, Core Scientific’s Chief Executive Officer. ""We successfully executed our growth strategy across multiple fronts, achieving significant milestones in both our HPC and Bitcoin mining operations"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,mw_unspecified,1300.0,MW,,unspecified,"Our infrastructure expansion efforts were particularly strong - through strategic site acquisitions and existing site expansions, we increased our total portfolio capacity to 1,300 MW of powered infrastructure by year-end"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,625.0,$M,,,"Additionally, we strengthened our financial foundation through an upsized $625 million senior convertible note offering, demonstrating the market's confidence in our vision and providing us with the capital to accelerate our growth initiatives."" . . . ""Looking ahead in 2025, we are executing on a clear strategy for accelerated growth, driven by unprecedented demand for HPC infrastructure and the continued strength of our Bitcoin mining operations"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,contract_value,94.9,$M,,,"Total revenue for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $94.9 million, consisting of $79.9 million in Digital asset self-mining revenue, $6.5 million in digital asset hosted mining revenue and $8.5 million in HPC hosting revenue"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,79.9,$M,,,"Total revenue for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $94.9 million, consisting of $79.9 million in Digital asset self-mining revenue, $6.5 million in digital asset hosted mining revenue and $8.5 million in HPC hosting revenue"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,6.5,$M,,,"Total revenue for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $94.9 million, consisting of $79.9 million in Digital asset self-mining revenue, $6.5 million in digital asset hosted mining revenue and $8.5 million in HPC hosting revenue"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,8.5,$M,,,"Total revenue for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $94.9 million, consisting of $79.9 million in Digital asset self-mining revenue, $6.5 million in digital asset hosted mining revenue and $8.5 million in HPC hosting revenue"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,1.7,$M,,,"Digital asset self-mining gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $1.7 million (2% gross margin), compared to $32.6 million (29% gross margin) for the same period in the prior year, a decrease of $30.9 million"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,32.6,$M,,,"Digital asset self-mining gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $1.7 million (2% gross margin), compared to $32.6 million (29% gross margin) for the same period in the prior year, a decrease of $30.9 million"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,30.9,$M,,,"Digital asset self-mining gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $1.7 million (2% gross margin), compared to $32.6 million (29% gross margin) for the same period in the prior year, a decrease of $30.9 million"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,32.3,$M,,,"The decrease in Digital asset self-mining gross profit was primarily driven by a $32.3 million decrease in self-mining revenue, the result of a 68% decrease in bitcoin mined due to the halving and the operational shift to HPC hosting, partially offset by a 130% increase in the average price of bitcoin"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,2.3,$M,,,"Digital asset hosted mining gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $2.3 million (36% gross margin), as compared to $6.7 million (23% gross margin) for the same period in the prior year"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,6.7,$M,,,"Digital asset hosted mining gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $2.3 million (36% gross margin), as compared to $6.7 million (23% gross margin) for the same period in the prior year"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,23.3,$M,,,"The decrease in Digital asset hosted mining gross profit was primarily due to a $23.3 million decrease in hosted mining revenue driven by the termination of contracts with several customers since 2023 in support of our shift to HPC hosting, partially offset by a 82% decrease in power costs due to lower rates and usage"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,power_cost,1,flag,,,"The decrease in Digital asset hosted mining gross profit was primarily due to a $23.3 million decrease in hosted mining revenue driven by the termination of contracts with several customers since 2023 in support of our shift to HPC hosting, partially offset by a 82% decrease in power costs due to lower rates and usage"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,0.7,$M,,,HPC hosting gross profit for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 was $0.7 million (9% gross margin)
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,power_cost,1,flag,,,"HPC hosting revenue includes a base license fee as well as the direct pass-through of power costs to our client, with no margin added"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,power_cost,1,flag,,,"HPC hosting costs at our Austin, Texas data center consist primarily of lease expense, the direct pass-through of power costs, and direct and indirect facilities operations expenses, including personnel and benefit costs and stock-based compensation"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,power_cost,1,flag,,,"The non-GAAP gross margin for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024, which excludes the direct pass-through of power costs, was 13%"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,contract_value,43.6,$M,,,"Operating expenses for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 totaled $43.6 million, as compared to $30.0 million for the same period in the prior year"
L000162828025008130_q42024corescientificinc-ea,contract_value,30.0,$M,,,"Operating expenses for the fiscal fourth quarter of 2024 totaled $43.6 million, as compared to $30.0 million for the same period in the prior year"
