L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,Expands Total Contracted HPC Infrastructure by CoreWeave to Approximately 590 Megawatts of Critical IT Load at Six Core Scientific Sites
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,contract_value,10200.0,$M,,,New Agreement Boosts Total Contracted Revenue to $10.2 Billion over 12-year Contract Terms
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,term_years,12.0,years,,,New Agreement Boosts Total Contracted Revenue to $10.2 Billion over 12-year Contract Terms
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"(NASDAQ: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-performance computing (HPC) at scale, today announced an expansion of its relationship with CoreWeave, an AI Hyperscaler"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,Hyperscaler,,,,"(NASDAQ: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-performance computing (HPC) at scale, today announced an expansion of its relationship with CoreWeave, an AI Hyperscaler"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,contract_value,1200.0,$M,,,"The new agreement brings $1.2 billion in contracted revenue across Core Scientific’s Denton TX location, solidifying Core Scientific’s position as a premier provider of application-specific data centers for HPC workloads"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_it,70.0,MW,,it,The 70 MW of expansion at the Denton site brings the full critical IT load to just over 260 MW
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_it,260.0,MW,over,it,The 70 MW of expansion at the Denton site brings the full critical IT load to just over 260 MW
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_unspecified,590.0,MW,approximately,unspecified,The expansion increases CoreWeave’s total contracted HPC infrastructure with Core Scientific to approximately 590 MW across six sites
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,The expansion increases CoreWeave’s total contracted HPC infrastructure with Core Scientific to approximately 590 MW across six sites
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"We believe these enhancements align with CoreWeave’s growing need for robust, high-density infrastructure to support NVIDIA GPU operations. . “We continue to expand our HPC hosting infrastructure,” said Adam Sullivan, Chief Executive Officer of Core Scientific. “By increasing our capacity at Denton, we are building one of the largest GPU supercomputers in North America"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,NVIDIA,,,,"We believe these enhancements align with CoreWeave’s growing need for robust, high-density infrastructure to support NVIDIA GPU operations. . “We continue to expand our HPC hosting infrastructure,” said Adam Sullivan, Chief Executive Officer of Core Scientific. “By increasing our capacity at Denton, we are building one of the largest GPU supercomputers in North America"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,usd_other,10000.0,$M,over,,"With over $10 billion in potential cumulative revenue with CoreWeave, we believe Core Scientific is strategically positioned to capitalize on the growing demand for energy-dense, application-specific data centers"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"With over $10 billion in potential cumulative revenue with CoreWeave, we believe Core Scientific is strategically positioned to capitalize on the growing demand for energy-dense, application-specific data centers"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_unspecified,70.0,MW,,unspecified,"Under the terms of this 70MW expansion, Core Scientific is responsible for funding $104 million of capex ($1.5M per MW) for the powered core and shell, with CoreWeave responsible for the additional capex associated with the expansion"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,financing_or_capex,104.0,$M,,,"Under the terms of this 70MW expansion, Core Scientific is responsible for funding $104 million of capex ($1.5M per MW) for the powered core and shell, with CoreWeave responsible for the additional capex associated with the expansion"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,financing_or_capex,1.5,$M,,,"Under the terms of this 70MW expansion, Core Scientific is responsible for funding $104 million of capex ($1.5M per MW) for the powered core and shell, with CoreWeave responsible for the additional capex associated with the expansion"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"Under the terms of this 70MW expansion, Core Scientific is responsible for funding $104 million of capex ($1.5M per MW) for the powered core and shell, with CoreWeave responsible for the additional capex associated with the expansion"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,term_years,5.0,years,,,The company also retains the option for two additional five-year renewal terms
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_unspecified,1300.0,MW,,unspecified,"With its 1.3 gigawatts of contracted power, Core Scientific plans to provide a total of approximately 900 MW of gross capacity for HPC hosting to support alternative compute workloads, based on geographic proximity to major cities and fiber lines"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_gross,900.0,MW,approximately,gross,"With its 1.3 gigawatts of contracted power, Core Scientific plans to provide a total of approximately 900 MW of gross capacity for HPC hosting to support alternative compute workloads, based on geographic proximity to major cities and fiber lines"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,mw_unspecified,400.0,MW,,unspecified,The remaining 400 MW of contracted power is currently allocated to support the Company’s bitcoin mining business
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"These statements include, but are not limited, statements regarding potential benefits of or expectations regarding the strategic relationship, agreements and contemplated transactions with CoreWeave, impacts on the Company’s revenue, financial and other operating results, completion and timing of certain events, impacts on the Company’s trading multiple and ability to deliver shareholder value, the Company’s intention and ability to capitalize on additional or related opportunities, and the Company’s plans, objectives, expectations and intentions"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"The Company’s actual results may differ materially from those anticipated in these forward-looking statements as a result of certain risks and other factors, which could include, but are not limited to, unanticipated difficulties or expenditures relating to the strategic relationship, agreements and contemplated transactions with CoreWeave"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,tenant,CoreWeave,,,,"occurrence of any event, change or other circumstance that could give rise to the termination of the contracts with CoreWeave"
L000162828025008312_ex991-coreweavepressrelease,credit_support,1,flag,,,"These forward-looking statements are not intended to serve, and must not be relied on by any investor, as a guarantee, an assurance, a prediction or a definitive statement of fact or probability"
