L000162828025023161_q12025corescientificinc-ea,contract_value,16.9,$M,,,"Selling, general and administrative expenses for the fiscal first quarter of 2025 totaled $40.1 million, as compared to $16.9 million for the same period in the prior year"
L000162828025023161_q12025corescientificinc-ea,usd_other,23.2,$M,,,"The increase of $23.2 million was primarily attributable to a $13.9 million increase in stock-based compensation, a $7.2 million increase in non-capitalizable Colocation site startup costs, and a $2.5 million increase in personnel and related expenses due to increased employee headcount to support our transition to Colocation operations"
