L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,usd_other,803.8,$M,,,"An established track record in commercial delivery Telix achieved record revenue of US$803.8M, a 56% increase year-over-year"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"The study is also approved to commence in China, Japan7, Singapore, South Korea, Türkiye and the United Kingdom, with U.S. and European expansion pending regulatory clearance"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,The Telix team is deeply aligned with our purpose and energized by the Company’s long-term vision
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"• TLX250-Tx (177Lu-DOTA-girentuximab): Received regulatory approval to commence LUTEON2, a global Phase 2/3 trial of TLX250-Tx as a monotherapy in advanced metastatic clear cell renal cell carcinoma (""ccRCC""), initiating sites"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"• TLX101-Tx (iodofalan 131I): Received regulatory approval in Australia and the European Union to commence the IPAX BrIGHT5 pivotal trial of TLX101-Tx in recurrent glioblastoma (""GBM"") with sites open for enrollment"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"Build the next generation of radiopharmaceuticals • TLX592-Tx (225Ac-PSMA-RADmAb): Received regulatory approval to commence AlphaPRO, a Phase 1, first-in- human (""FIH"") study of Telix's targeted alpha therapy (""TAT"") candidate in advanced mCRPC"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"• TLX252-Tx (225Ac-DOTA-girentuximab): Received regulatory approval to commence ALPHIX, a Phase 1, FIH study of Telix's TAT candidate for the treatment of patients with advanced metastatic kidney cancer and other carbonic anhydrase IX (""CAIX"") expressing cancers"
L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,power_cost,1,flag,,,"• Acquired a pipeline of next generation therapeutic candidates, proprietary novel biologics technology platform, and protein engineering and discovery research facility from antibody engineering company ImaginAb, Inc.3 Grow our industry-leading precision medicine business • Gozellix®: Launched in the U.S. following FDA approval and reimbursement by Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS), via a Level II HCPCS code4 and transitional pass through (TPT) payment status effective 1 October 20255"
