L000162828026009887_a20260220appendix4eand20,rfs,1,flag,,,"In 2025, we received regulatory approval in Australia and the European Union to commence the Phase 3 IPAX-BrIGHT pivotal trial of TLX101-Tx with sites open for enrollment, and received regulatory approval in Australia to commence LUTEON, a global Phase 2/3 trial of TLX250-Tx"
