L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,rfs,1,flag,,,"Even as energy systems change, global economic growth depends on supply that is available, reliable and delivered at scale"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,rfs,1,flag,,,"At our Capital Markets Day 2023, we said we would invest $10--15 billion in low-carbon energy solutions between 2023 and 2025, which we have delivered on"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,usd_other,500.0,$M,,,"In 2025, we also spent almost $500 million on research and development projects that aim to contribute to decarbonisation, representing about 41% of our total research and development expenditure"
