L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,rfs,1,flag,,,"In 2025, we delivered on the financial targets that we set out at our Capital Markets Day 2023 and, as a result, we set more ambitious financial targets at our Capital Markets Day 2025"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,usd_other,5100.0,$M,,,"We reached $5.1 billion in structural cost reductions* by the end of 2025, compared with 2022, three years ahead of our target, with more to come"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,rfs,1,flag,,,"In 2025, we delivered shareholder distributions at the top end of our target of 40--50% of cash flow from operations* through the cycle [D]"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,rfs,1,flag,,,"While we have delivered in many areas, there is still more to do"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,usd_other,20000.0,$M,,,"Today we have around $20 billion of our capital employed* across lower-carbon platforms, including power (both gas- fired and from renewable energy), low-carbon fuels, hydrogen, and carbon capture and storage [F]"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,annual_revenue,21000.0,$M,,,"We plan cash capital expenditure* within the range of $20--22 billion per year between 2025 and 2028, with $21 billion in 2025"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,usd_other,5100.0,$M,,,"By the end of 2025, we had already achieved structural cost reductions* of $5.1 billion since 2022 with more to come"
