L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,credit_support,1,flag,,,"Our financial framework aims to enhance shareholder distributions and maintain discipline in capital allocation, and targets a strong credit investment grade rating"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,contract_value,485.0,$M,,,"In 2025, our R&D expenditure on projects that aim to contribute to decarbonisation was around $485 million, representing about 41% of our total R&D spend, compared with around 45% in 2024"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,mw_unspecified,609.0,MW,,unspecified,"The divestment was in line with Shell's ongoing efforts to high-grade its Chemicals and Products business; and ￮ the acquisition of RISEC Holdings, LLC and its 609 MW two-unit combined-cycle gas turbine power plant by our Renewables and Energy Solutions business in January 2025"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,Construction continued on the REFHYNE II 100 MW hydrogen electrolyser at Shell Energy and Chemicals Park Rheinland
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,mw_unspecified,100.0,MW,,unspecified,"Vodafone Procure & Connect will access part of the operational benefits from Shell's 100 MW, 3‑hour battery site in Hampshire -- one of the UK's largest grid‑connected facilities"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,tenant,Google,,,,"In September 2025, Google selected Shell Energy Europe Limited as its renewable energy supply manager in the UK, under the USA- based technology company's Carbon-Free Energy supply model to reach its goal of running entirely on clean energy by 2030"
L000162828026017027_shellannualreportandacco,mw_unspecified,609.0,MW,,unspecified,"Key portfolio changes included the completion of the sale of The Shell Petroleum Development Company of Nigeria Limited (SPDC) by our Upstream business in March 2025, the sale of Shell Energy and Chemicals Park Singapore by our Chemicals and Products business in April 2025 and the acquisition of RISEC Holdings, LLC and its 609 MW two-unit combined-cycle gas turbine power plant by our Renewables and Energy Solutions business in January 2025"
