L000162828026027645_exhibit991-pecosexpansio,mw_gross,1500.0,MW,,gross,"EX-99.1 2 exhibit991-pecosexpansio.htm EX-99.1 exhibit991-pecosexpansio Core Scientific Plans Expansion to 1.5 Gigawatts of Gross Power at Pecos, Texas Campus AUSTIN, Texas, April 27, 2026 – Core Scientific, Inc"
L000162828026027645_exhibit991-pecosexpansio,mw_it,1500.0,MW,approximately,it,"(Nasdaq: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-density colocation (“HDC”), today announced a multi-tiered strategy to scale its Pecos, Texas campus to approximately 1.5 gigawatts (“GW”) of gross power, or approximately 1.0 GW of leasable power"
L000162828026027645_exhibit991-pecosexpansio,mw_it,1000.0,MW,approximately,it,"(Nasdaq: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-density colocation (“HDC”), today announced a multi-tiered strategy to scale its Pecos, Texas campus to approximately 1.5 gigawatts (“GW”) of gross power, or approximately 1.0 GW of leasable power"
L000162828026027645_exhibit991-pecosexpansio,mw_gross,300.0,MW,,gross,"Earlier this year, Core Scientific began transforming its Pecos campus, where 300 megawatts (“MW”) of gross power capacity are currently used for bitcoin mining, into a data center campus for AI infrastructure"
L000162828026027645_exhibit991-pecosexpansio,mw_gross,300.0,MW,,gross,"In addition, Core Scientific has secured an incremental 300 MW of gross power capacity under contract with its utility provider"
