L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_gross,1500.0,MW,,gross,"EX-99.1 3 exhibit991polarispressre.htm EX-99.1 exhibit991polarispressre Core Scientific Plans Expansion to 1.5 Gigawatts of Gross Power at Muskogee, Oklahoma Campus AUSTIN, Texas, May 6, 2026 – Core Scientific, Inc"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_it,1500.0,MW,approximately,it,"(Nasdaq: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-density colocation (“HDC”), today announced a multi-tiered strategy to scale its Muskogee, Oklahoma campus to approximately 1.5 gigawatt (“GW”) of gross power, or approximately 1.0 GW of leasable power"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_it,1000.0,MW,approximately,it,"(Nasdaq: CORZ) (“Core Scientific” or the “Company”), a leader in digital infrastructure for high-density colocation (“HDC”), today announced a multi-tiered strategy to scale its Muskogee, Oklahoma campus to approximately 1.5 gigawatt (“GW”) of gross power, or approximately 1.0 GW of leasable power"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_gross,440.0,MW,,gross,"As part of this strategy, Core Scientific has entered into an agreement to acquire Polaris DS LLC, which has contracted 440 megawatts (“MW”) of gross power under an energy agreement with Oklahoma Gas & Electric and is actively being utilized"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_unspecified,82.5,MW,,unspecified,"The acquisition is expected to meaningfully accelerate the Company’s timeline for delivering significant new capacity for future customers in Muskogee, and construction has already begun on a second, unleased 82.5 MW building, with initial delivery expected in the fourth quarter of 2027"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,mw_unspecified,70.0,MW,,unspecified,"-more- In Muskogee, the Company’s current leased 70 MW building designed to support the Nvidia GB300 platform is progressing through final testing as well as commissioning and is on track for a second quarter 2026 delivery to its customer"
L000162828026030918_exhibit991polarispressre,tenant,Nvidia,,,,"-more- In Muskogee, the Company’s current leased 70 MW building designed to support the Nvidia GB300 platform is progressing through final testing as well as commissioning and is on track for a second quarter 2026 delivery to its customer"
