L000164033426001589_stark_ex991,mw_unspecified,15.0,MW,,unspecified,"In addition to our data center initiative in South Asia, we began conducting an active site search for additional data center locations beginning in late June 2026, assessing several opportunities in the United States, including one in South Dakota (15 MW available on a 400 MW line), a 34-site portfolio, two 75 MW Texas power studies, and sites in Mississippi, Kansas, and Iowa, a second site in South Dakota (approximately 50 MW) and a 160-acre site in Texas (with a prior 140 MW power study and a 750 MW colocation proposal)"
