L000168316825002328_edgemode_8k,mw_gross,75.0,MW,,gross,"The property is located at Marviken Kraftverk, 610 27 Vikbolandet, Sweden and we plan to build an additional datacenter with 75MW gross capacity (the “75MW Center”)"
L000168316825002328_edgemode_8k,mw_gross,75.0,MW,,gross,"The property is located at Marviken Kraftverk, 610 27 Vikbolandet, Sweden and we plan to build an additional datacenter with 75MW gross capacity (the “75MW Center”)"
L000168316825002328_edgemode_8k,mw_unspecified,20.0,MW,,unspecified,"Regarding both the 20MW Center and the 75MW Center, we will not commence building until the clients are secured"
