L000181998925000110_ciphermining_businessupd,mw_unspecified,1000.0,MW,,unspecified,"Secured 1 GW Site Expected to Energize in 2028 • Cipher expects to own ~95% of joint venture equity assuming standard HPC lease and development assumptions • 1 GW of capacity supported by a signed Direct Connect Agreement with AEP – Anticipated power consumption in 2028 pending ERCOT approval • Transaction includes land purchase options of up to 620 acres • Site is well-suited for HPC application given its large-scale potential power capacity, sizable acreage, availability of diverse fiber paths, and dual interconnection capability 1 GW Fully Executed DCA with AEP(1) 620 Acres Total Acreage Under Option New Site: Colchis 4 Colchis Barber Lake (1) DCA: Direct Connect Agreement"
