L000181998925000110_nov3_earningspressreleasex,mw_unspecified,300.0,MW,,unspecified,"Under the terms of this lease agreement, Cipher will deliver 300 MW of capacity in 2026, including both air and liquid cooling to the racks"
L000181998925000110_nov3_earningspressreleasex,rfs,1,flag,,,"The capacity will be delivered in two phases, expected to begin in July 2026 and complete in the fourth quarter of 2026, with rent commencing in August 2026"
L000181998925000110_nov3_earningspressreleasex,rfs,1,flag,,,"Since then, we’ve delivered on that vision, executing two milestone HPC transactions, as well as our most significant pipeline addition to date,” said Mr"
