L000183934126000012_amdpr,mw_unspecified,500.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"EX-99.1 2 amdpr.htm EX-99.1 amdpr Core Scientific and AMD Announce Infrastructure Partnership News Highlights: • Partnership expands AMD ecosystem access to AI-ready infrastructure to support growing demand for AMD compute • AMD secures more than 500 megawatts of U.S. capacity to support end customer deployments beginning in 2027, with the ability to expand up to 2.5 gigawatts MIAMI, Florida and SANTA CLARA, Calif., July 28, 2026 — Core Scientific (NASDAQ: CORZ) and AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) today announced a partnership to shape the future of AI infrastructure, with AMD to secure up to 2.5 gigawatts of data center capacity to support end customer deployments of AMD AI solutions"
L000183934126000012_amdpr,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,up to,unspecified,"EX-99.1 2 amdpr.htm EX-99.1 amdpr Core Scientific and AMD Announce Infrastructure Partnership News Highlights: • Partnership expands AMD ecosystem access to AI-ready infrastructure to support growing demand for AMD compute • AMD secures more than 500 megawatts of U.S. capacity to support end customer deployments beginning in 2027, with the ability to expand up to 2.5 gigawatts MIAMI, Florida and SANTA CLARA, Calif., July 28, 2026 — Core Scientific (NASDAQ: CORZ) and AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) today announced a partnership to shape the future of AI infrastructure, with AMD to secure up to 2.5 gigawatts of data center capacity to support end customer deployments of AMD AI solutions"
L000183934126000012_amdpr,mw_unspecified,2500.0,MW,up to,unspecified,"EX-99.1 2 amdpr.htm EX-99.1 amdpr Core Scientific and AMD Announce Infrastructure Partnership News Highlights: • Partnership expands AMD ecosystem access to AI-ready infrastructure to support growing demand for AMD compute • AMD secures more than 500 megawatts of U.S. capacity to support end customer deployments beginning in 2027, with the ability to expand up to 2.5 gigawatts MIAMI, Florida and SANTA CLARA, Calif., July 28, 2026 — Core Scientific (NASDAQ: CORZ) and AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) today announced a partnership to shape the future of AI infrastructure, with AMD to secure up to 2.5 gigawatts of data center capacity to support end customer deployments of AMD AI solutions"
L000183934126000012_amdpr,mw_unspecified,500.0,MW,more than,unspecified,"The agreement expands capacity for the AMD ecosystem with more than 500 megawatts of U.S. infrastructure beginning in 2027, with the opportunity to scale up to 2.5 gigawatts"
