L000185939226000009_exhibit992-glxyq42025ove,usd_other,5000.0,$M,,,"Consists of $6.4B Assets Under Management, $5.0B Assets Under Stake and $887M of assets managed by a commodity pool operator within Galaxy’s Global Markets division"
L000185939226000009_exhibit992-glxyq42025ove,usd_other,887.0,$M,,,"Consists of $6.4B Assets Under Management, $5.0B Assets Under Stake and $887M of assets managed by a commodity pool operator within Galaxy’s Global Markets division"
L000185939226000009_exhibit992-glxyq42025ove,contract_value,1600.0,$M,,,"Of this total, $1.6B is included in both Assets Under Management and Assets Under Stake, and $790M is included in both assets under stake and the commodity pool operator"
L000185939226000009_exhibit992-glxyq42025ove,usd_other,790.0,$M,,,"Of this total, $1.6B is included in both Assets Under Management and Assets Under Stake, and $790M is included in both assets under stake and the commodity pool operator"
L000185939226000009_exhibit992-glxyq42025ove,usd_other,10000.0,$M,,,"Complementary offerings across two main operating businesses: Operating Track Record 8+ Years Employees Across 3 Continents1 700+ Market Cap as of February 2, 2026 $10B Since 2018 (NASDAQ/TSX: GLXY) Publicly Listed Assets on Platform2 $12B Data Centers Developing world-class, high-performance computing infrastructure designed to meet the growing demand for large-scale, power-ready facilities"
