L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,mw_unspecified,160.0,MW,,unspecified,"The key assumptions include: • A base case scenario assuming recent Bitcoin economics including Bitcoin prices and global hashrate; • Three operational sites in British Columbia, Canada with installed nameplate capacity of 160MW; 80MW Mackenzie, 50MW Prince George and 30MW Canal Flats; • A fourth operational site at Childress, Texas with installed nameplate capacity of 100MW as at 31 July 2024 incrementally increasing to 350 MW by 31 December 2024; • Securing additional financing as required to achieve the Group’s growths objectives"
