L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,fitout,1,flag,,,The Group measures the fair value of prepaid electricity using the forward price approach
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,fitout,1,flag,,,"The fair value is calculated by multiplying the quantity of electricity prepaid by a forward price for the Energy Reliability Council of Texas (“ERCOT”) West Load Zone market, which is the principal market for our electricity transactions"
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,fitout,1,flag,,,The forward prices used to measure the fair value of prepaid electricity are classified as Level 2 inputs under AASB 13
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,"Mining and HPC hardware includes both installed hardware units and units that have been delivered but are in storage, yet to be installed"
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,Depreciation of mining hardware commences once units are onsite and available for use
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,A right-of-use asset is recognized at the commencement date of a lease
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,"The cost of the right-of-use assets includes the amount of the lease liability recognized, adjusted for, as applicable, any lease payments made at or before the commencement date net of any lease incentives received, any initial direct costs incurred, and, except where included in the cost of inventories, an estimate of costs expected to be incurred for dismantling and removing the underlying asset, and restoring the site or asset"
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,Right-of-use assets are depreciated from the commencement of the lease on a straight- line basis over the shorter of the lease term and the estimated useful lives of the assets
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,"At the commencement date of the lease, the Group recognizes lease liabilities measured at the present value of the lease payments to be made over the lease term"
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,credit_support,1,flag,,,"The lease payments include fixed payments (including in-substance fixed payments) less any lease incentives receivable, variable lease payments that depend on an index or a rate, and amount expected to be paid under residual value guarantees"
L000187884824000009_irenfy24annualreportaus,rfs,1,flag,,,Computer hardware prepayments Computer hardware prepayments represent payments made by the Group for the purchase of mining and HPC hardware that were yet to be delivered as of the end of the financial year
