L000187884825000043_q3fy25presentationvf,mw_unspecified,156000.0,MW,,unspecified,"Nvidia Reports ~3x in 5 years ~3.5x in 5 years 156 GW 953m • AI requires a new class of infrastructure • Legacy data centers are struggling to keep up: • New designs – rack density has increased ~225% YoY • New construction speeds – requiring flexibility and adaptability • New scale – 50-1,000MW clusters vs. avg. legacy data center of 5-10MW • New grid-connection timelines – up to 5-7 years if starting from scratch • IREN is positioned to meet this transition with existing and future capacity Note: Refer to assumptions and notes on page 24 11"
