L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,usd_other,48.8,$M,,,"Revenue Increased 14.5% Year-Over-Year, Record Bookings of $64.7 Million, Net Loss of $48.8 Million Reflects Pre-IPO Capital Structure, and Adjusted EBITDA Grew 21% to $120.3M"
