L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,usd_other,120.3,$M,,,• Adjusted EBITDA increased 21.0% year-over-year to $120.3 million demonstrating the operating leverage of the Company’s platform
L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,usd_other,64.7,$M,,,"(NYSE: CSQR) (""Csquare"" or the ""Company""), a leading provider of carrier-neutral data center solutions, today reported financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. . ""Our second quarter results demonstrate the disciplined execution by our team and the continued strength of Csquare's platform,"" said Spencer Mullee, Chief Executive Officer of Csquare. ""We delivered 14.5% revenue growth, achieved a record $64.7 million in bookings, increased Adjusted EBITDA by 21%, and continued to benefit from strong demand for our carrier-neutral digital infrastructure platform.” . ""These results reflect the durability of our recurring revenue model, the strength of customer demand across our markets, and the operating leverage inherent in our business as Adjusted EBITDA margin increased 330 basis points to 46.2%"
L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,rfs,1,flag,,,"(NYSE: CSQR) (""Csquare"" or the ""Company""), a leading provider of carrier-neutral data center solutions, today reported financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. . ""Our second quarter results demonstrate the disciplined execution by our team and the continued strength of Csquare's platform,"" said Spencer Mullee, Chief Executive Officer of Csquare. ""We delivered 14.5% revenue growth, achieved a record $64.7 million in bookings, increased Adjusted EBITDA by 21%, and continued to benefit from strong demand for our carrier-neutral digital infrastructure platform.” . ""These results reflect the durability of our recurring revenue model, the strength of customer demand across our markets, and the operating leverage inherent in our business as Adjusted EBITDA margin increased 330 basis points to 46.2%"
L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,usd_other,260.2,$M,,,"Revenue excluding metered power increased 12.3% to $260.2 million , underscoring the continued strength of the Company's recurring revenue base and customer expansion activity"
L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,contract_value,280.4,$M,,,"Second quarter total revenue increased 14.5% year-over-year to $280.4 million , compared to $244.8 million in the prior-year period"
L000210539826000002_csqr-ex99_1,contract_value,244.8,$M,,,"Second quarter total revenue increased 14.5% year-over-year to $280.4 million , compared to $244.8 million in the prior-year period"
